<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id">2 Khang Tangthu</book>
  <para style="h">2 Khang Tangthu</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Khang Tangthu</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Khang Tangthu</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Khang Tangthu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kumpi gam sungah David’ tapa Solomon ama le ama kiptahin om hi; Topa a Pasien in ama ompi a, a lien mama-in ama a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in Israel mi zosie, a tul uhte le a za uhte, thukhente, Israel makaite zosie, le innkuon lutangte hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Solomon le ama tawh a om mi buppi, Gibeon-a munsangah a pei uhi; bangzieh ahei cile gamlahah Topa’ nasem Moses in a na lamsa ahi Pasien’ kikhopna puonbuh khu tuanah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />(Ahi vangin David in Kiriath-jearim panin ama dinga a bawlpieh nasa munah Pasien’ thuciemna singkuong puoto zo hi; bangzieh ahei cile ama in Jerusalem-ah tua adingin puonbuh khat lampieh zo hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua tham loin, Hur’ tapa Uri, a tapa Bezalel in a na bawlsa sumngo maitam zong Topa’ biehbuh mai tua munah a om hi. Tua munah Solomon le a kikhawm mite in thu a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh-a om Topa’ mai-a sumngo maitam ah Solomon peito-in tua tungah meihal biehna tulkhat a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuami zanin Solomon tungah Pasien kilah a, ama kungah, “Kang pieh ding pen ngen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Solomon in Pasien kungah, “Ka pa David tungah a lien le a kip itna na lah zo a, keima kumpi-in ama’ za nei luosah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa Pasien aw, leitungah leivui za banga a tam mite lahah kumpi dingin nei koi zo tah ziehin ka pa David kunga na thuciemna tu-in hing tangtungsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam mite mai-a ka sungtum ka pusuo thei nadingin tu-in pilna le theina ei pie in, azieh pen hiza taha a tam na mite koi in uh zo ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien in Solomon dawng a, “Tam thu na lungsim sungah om a, nangma in nei le lamte, hauna, patawina, ahi sihle nang ang mudate’ si nading, le khansauna na ngen sih a, amate tungah kumpi-a kang koina ka mite na uh thei nadingin nang adingin pilna le theina nang nget zawh ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />na tungah pilna le theina ang kipie hi. Keima in nangma tungah na masanga kumpite koima in a nei ngai lo le na nua-ate koima in zong tua bang a nei ngai nawn lo ding haunate, nei le lamte, le patawinate zong kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n Gibeon-a om munsang kikhopna puonbuh mai panin Jerusalem ah Solomon a pei hi. Tuale ama in Israel tungah a uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Solomon in leengte le sakolte kaikhawm hi; ama in leeng tulkhat le zali le sakol tul sawm le tulni nei a, tuate leeng khuopite le Jerusalem ah kumpipa tawh koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa in Jerusalem ah suongpem tam bangin ngun tamsah a, taamtah sing zong Shephelah theitheh sing vau bangin vausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomon sakolte zong Egypt gam le Kue gam pana kila ahi hi; kumpipa’ sumbawlte in a man ding pie-in Kue panin tuate a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Egypt gam panin leeng khat ngun shekel zaguh, sakol khat shekel za le sawmnga-in a la uhi; tuaci’n amate tung panin Hit kumpite zosie le Aram kumpite tungah tuate kizuasawnkia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon in Topa’ min dingin biehinn khat le ama adingin kumpi inn khat lam ding a khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in na sem ding mi tul sawmsagi le muoltung gama suong to ding mi tul sawmgiet, le tuate a van dingin mi tulthum le zaguh se hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon in Tyre Kumpi Huram kungah thu vaihlah a, “Hun khat lai-in ten nading inn khat a lam nadingin ka pa David tungah taamtah sing na puoh ma bangin kei tungah zong ei puoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel adingin khantawn zah dinga a kise bangin, ama mai-ah gim namtuite ahi panamtui hal nading, le anlum guolte pieh thei zing nading, le sabbath nite, hladet nite, le Topa kohaw’ Pasien dinga a kisesa pawi nite-ah zing le nitahin meihal biehnate pieh thei nadingin Topa ka Pasien’ minin tu-in biehinn khat lamin ama tunga ap ding ka hi ta hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kote’ Pasien pen pasien dangte sanga a lietzawh ziehin ka biehinn lam ding zong a gol ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin vantung, a sang pen vantung nangawnin ama dawl lo ahi ziehin koi in ama adingin biehinn lam zo ding ahei? Ama mai-ah biehnate koi nading mun ci longal ama dinga biehinn lampieh dingin kei koi ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n tu-in ka pa David in a na zahsa, Judah le Jerusalem-a ka ompi khutsiem mite tawh kithuo dingin kham, ngun, sumngo, le sia khensiem, le puon a ausan, a dupsan, puondum a gat siem mi khat ka kungah hing sawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Taamtah, taasing, le cingsing zong Lebanon panin keima kungah ei puoh in, azieh pen na nasemte, Lebanon sing phua a siem lam uh ka thei hi. Ka nasemte in na nasemte tawh a semton ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />kei adingin sing tampitah a khol ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile ka lam ding biehinn pen golin lamdang mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in na nasem sing phuate adingin a kisuvui mangbu cor tul sawmni, mangbuham cor tul sawmni, lenggazu bath tul sawmni, le sathau bath tul sawmni kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Tyre kumpipa Huram in Solomon lai hlah a, “ Topa in a mite a it ziehin amate tungah nang kumpi-in ang koi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huram in zong, “ Topa ading biehinn khat le ama ading kumpi inn khat a lam ding, thu ngaisut theina le thu theitelna a nei, Kumpi David’ tungah tapa pil a pie, van le lei a bawl Israel Topa Pasien in thupha nga taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Keima in mi khutsiem mama le thuteina tawh a kidim Huram-abi kang sawl zo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ama pen Dan-te numei khat’ tapa hi a, a pa Tyre-te ahi hi; ama pen kham, ngun, sumngo, sia, suong, le sing, le puon ausan, puondum, le puon sandupte, le saihadiel puon, le suong zepdan namkim a sem ding le keima’ pu na pa David’ mi khutsiemte tawh a kithuo dingin ama tunga kipie nasep khat popo a sem dingin siemna neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in ka pu in a gensa mangbu le mangbuham, sathau le lenggazute, na nasemte tungah hing puoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kote in na kisap sing poma Lebanon panin kang phua ding vua, tuaci’n phawng bawlin na kungah tui lam tawh Joppa dong kang puoh ding uhi; Jerusalem ah tua teng na puohto ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pa David in mi phaza a sim zo-in Solomon in zong Israel gam sunga teng gamdang mi phaza zosie sim a, mi tul zakhat le tul sawmnga le tulthum le zaguh pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in tua teng lahah na sem dingin mi tul sawm sagi, muoltung gama suong to dingin mi tul sawmgiet, le mite’ nasep a van dingin mi tulthum le zaguh se hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon in Jerusalem khuopi sunga Moriah Muol tung, a pa David kungah Topa a na kihilna mun, David in a na senasa mun, Jebus-te Ornan’ ancilna phuolah Topa’ biehinn lam kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama a maan zaw a kum lina, a hla nina, a ni nina sungin lam ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam teng pen Pasien’ biehinn lamna dinga Solomon’ tena ahi hi: sil tena lui tawh a kite leh adung tong sawmguh, avai tong sawmni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Biehinn laikim mai-a om talaap pen biehinn vailam tawh kikimin tong sawmni sau a, a sanna tong za le sawmni pha hi; ama in a sunglam teng kham citah tawh zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in taasing tawh biehinn laikim teng dapin tuate kham hoi tawh tuom a, tua tungah tumsing le khainieng lim a kheng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in suongmanpha guolte tawh a inn zem hi. A khamte pen Parvaim pana kham ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a inn, a innkam, a sangkilte, a kawmte, le a kotkhahte kham tawh dap hi; tuale ama in a kawmte tungah cherub-te a kheng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in siengtho pen mun bawl hi; adung pen a inn vailam tawh a kibangin tong sawm ni hi a, avai pen tong sawmni ma ahi hi; ama in tua pen kham hoi talent zaguh tawh zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kilnate a gihna kham shekel sawmnga ahi hi. Ama in kham tawh innkhan tungnungte zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in siengtho pen mun sungah a kikheng cherub ni bawlin kham tawh tuate a zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cherub gel’ hla a kizah ciengin tong sawmni sau hi: a khat’ hla langkhat tong nga ahi a, tua in inn kawm ban a, a hla langkhat zong tong nga ma ahi a, tua in adang cherub’ hla langkhat ban hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A cherub dang khat’ hla langkhat tong nga sau a, tua in inn kawm banin tong nga ma a sau a hla langkhat pen a cherub masa’ hla tawh kimat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam cherub-te’ hla in tong sawmni huom a, tua cherub-te a kephang utawh dingin innpi sunglam a kinga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Solomon in puon a dum, a ausan, a sandup, le saihadiel puon tawh dalna puon bawl a, tua tungah cherub-te a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in inn mai-ah tong sawmthum le tong nga a sang, a dawn tuohah tong nga a pha khuom luzepna a nei khuompi ni a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in khigui bangin khainieng bawlin khuomte dawnah tuate khai hi; tuale ama in mang kawlsing lim zakhat bawlin khainiengte tungah tuate koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in biehinnpi mai-ah tua khuompite, khat a veilam, a khat a zietlamah phut hi; ama in ziet lama pen Jachin ci a, vei lama pen Boaz ci-in minvaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama in sumngo maitam, adung tong sawmni, avai tong sawmni, a sanna tong sawm a pha khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a kisung tuikuongpi khat bawl hi; tua khu a bem ahi a, a gei khat pan a gei khat dong tong sawm pha-in, tong nga sang a, a kimvel tong sawmthum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A geiviel nei lamah tuikuongpi kimvelin tong sawm ciet a pha a khawhte a om hi; a khawhte guol ni pha a, tua khu tuikuongpi kisun lai-a kisuntha pai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawngtang sawm le nite tungah tuikuong kikhang a, thum leilu lam nga a, thum nitumna lam nga-in, thum leitaw lam nga a, thum nisuona lam nga hi; tuate tungah tuikuongpi kikhang hi. Bawngtangte’ nua lam pen a sung lamah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tuikuong pen khutphang cie-in sa hi; a geiviel pen unoh pa tawh kibang hai geiviel bangin kibawl hi; tua sungah tui bath tulthum bang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a sungah kisil nading tuikuong sawm zong bawl a, zietlam pangah nga, veilam pangah nga koi hi. Amate in meihal biehna dinga a kizangte tam sungah sil sieng ding uhi. Tuikuong pen siempute kisil nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in a kigielsa bangin kham meivah tunna sawm khat bawl a, tuate biehinn sung leitaw lamah nga, leilu lamah nga koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in sabuoi sawm zong bawl a, biehinn sung zietlam pangah nga, veilam pangah nga koi hi. Tuale ama in kham kuong zakhat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in siempute’ leituol, le leituol golpi, le leituol kotkhahte bawl a, a kotkhahte sumngo tawh a zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in innhlang nisuona lam ningah tuikuongpi koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huram in beelte, kawbiate, le kuongte zong bawl hi. Huram in tam bangin Kumpi Solomon ading Pasien’ biehinn bawl nasep a zawsa teng:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuompi nite, kuongkumte, khuompite dawna a lubawh nite; khuompite dawn a kuong tawh kibang a lubawh nite tuom nading lenta banga kiphan nite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />lenta banga a kiphan nite ading mang kawlsing ga zali, khuompite dawn a kuong tawh kibang a lubawh nite tuom nadingin lenta banga a kiphan khat ading mang kawlsing ga guol ni ta ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in a tunnate le tua a tunnate tungah kuongpite bawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tui kuongpi khat, tua nei-a a om bawngtang sawm le nite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpi Solomon adingin Topa’ biehinn-a zah ding beelte, kawbiate, tawkeukate, le khutzah zosie pen Humara-abi in a paa silsel sumngo tawh a bawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam a kisiem na zosie pen kumpipa in Jordan zanglei Succoth le Zeredah kikal beel lei-a a na sun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Solomon in tami nate zosie tampi bawlsah a, tuaci’n a kizang sumngote a gihza kite zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n Solomon in Pasien’ biehinn sunga na zosie a bawlsahte: Kham maitam, Ompina Anlum ading sabuoite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a kigielsa ma bangin biehinn sungnung mai-a kivah ding kham citah meivah tunnate le a meivahte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />kham hoi pen tawh a kibawl papete, meivahte, le a tenate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />kham citah tawh a kibawl taitete, kuongte, tawkeute, le vutluonate ahi hi. Biehinnpi lutna kotbieng tawh kisai-in: Siengtho pen mun pei nading kotkhahte le biehinn laikim kotkhah-a kizang dingte pen kham tawh kibawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Solomon in Topa’ biehinn ading nasep zosie a man sieng hi. A pa David in a apsa nate Solomon in peipi-in, ngun, kham, le vanzah zosie Pasien’ biehinn sung vanmanpha koinate sungah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Solomon in Zion a kici David’ khuopi panin Topa’ thuciemna singkuong a puoto dingin Jerusalem ah Israel upate, minam lutangte, le Israel minam pupa innkuon makai zosie a kikhawmsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hla sagina sunga pawi bawl hunin Israel-te zosie kumpipa mai-ah a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel upa zosie pei-in Levi-te in tua singkuong a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in singkuong, kikhopna puonbuh, le puonbuh sunga vanzah siengtho zosie a puoto uhi; siempute le Levi-te in tuate a puoto uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Singkuong mai-ah kumpi Solomon le a mai-a kikhawm Israel zosie in biehpiehna-in tuu le bawngtangte tam pieh seng uh ahi ziehin tuate a phaza kisim zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin cherub-te’ hla nei, biehinn sungnung mun siengtho penah siempute in Topa’ thuciemna singkuong a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cherub-te in singkuong tungah a hlate uh a zah ziehin tua cherub-te pen singkuong le a zawlte tunga a khuna khat a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zawlte sau mama a, mun siengtho sungnung mai panin zawl mongte kimu thei hi; hizongle a pulam panin kimu thei lo hi; tuni dongin tua munah tuate a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Egypt panin a peikhiet zaw uh Topa in Israel mite tawh thuciemna a bawlna mun Horeb ah Moses in suongpeh ni a koi ci simlo, singkuong sungah bangma dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in a siengtho mun panin siem-pute pusuohin (azieh pen amau’ pawlte ci om tuon loin tua taha om siempute zosie a unpi-un a kisiensuo vua),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Levi lasate Asaph, Hemen, le Jeduthun, a tapate ule a tanaute uh, saihadiel puon tawh kivonin, daltuote, harp te, le lyre lasahnate tawi-in pengkul tum siempute za le sawmni tawh maitam nisuona lamah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa tungah aw kikhatin phatna le lungdam ko ding pen pengkul tumte le lasate’ mawpuoh ahi hi. Pengkulte, daltuote, le adang lasahnate tawh Topa phat nadingin, “Azieh pen Topa hoi a, ama’ itna kip tawntung hi,” ci-in la kisa a, tuaci’n Topa’ biehinn sung meii tawh kidim a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />meii a kai ziehin siempute in na a sem zo sih uhi; bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ minthanna a vangtang Pasien’ biehinn sung a dim hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Solomon in, “ Topa in khuomiel tawkhal lahah ka teng ding hi, ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in na ten zing nadingin a thupi biehinn khat nang adingin ka lam zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa kinua hei-in, a kikhawm Israel mi zosie a din laitahun ama in a kikhawm Israel mi zosie thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in, “Ka pa David tungah a kam tawh a ciemsa a khut tawh a tangtungsah Israel Pasien in minthanna nga ta hinlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Egypt gam pan ka mite ka peipi ni-a kipanin tua sungah ka min a op thei nadinga a sunga biehinn lam nadingin Israel minamte khat popo panin khuopi khatpo ka teel sih a, ka mi Israel tunga uhpa dingin koima khat zong ka teel sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hizongle keima in khum sungah ka min a op thei nadingin Jerusalem ka teel zo ta a, ka mi Israel tunga uhpa dingin David ka teel zo ta hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel Pasien Topa’ min dingin biehinn khat lam ding ka pa David’ lungsim sungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanle Topa in ka pa David kungah, “Keima’ min dingin biehinn khat lam dinga na ngaisut pen hoi mama hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hinanle nang in biehinn na lam sih ding a, na sung pana ang pieng ding na tapa in ka min dingin biehinn a lamzaw ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tu-in Topa in a bawlsa ama’ thuciemna a tangtungsah zo hi; azieh pen Topa’ thuciem bangin ka pa David za luo-in Israel kumpi topha tungah ka to a, Israel Pasien, Topa’ min dingin biehinn ka lam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mite tawh a bawl Topa’ thuciemna singkuong tua munah ka koi zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin a kikhawm Israel mi zosie’ opna Topa’ maitam mai-ah Solomon dingin a khut a zah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomon in adung tong nga, avai tong nga, a sanna tong thum a pha thugenna sumngo tau khat bawlin leituolah koi zo hi; tuale ama tua tungah a ding hi. Tua ciengin a kikhawm Israel mi vannuoi muna-ah khupdinin a khut gel van lamah a zah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in, “Israel Pasien, Topa aw, thuciemna zui-in a lungsim zosie utawh nangma’ thu ang mang na nasemte tungah itna kip a lah nang bang Pasien dang vantungah hile, leitungah hile a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na nasempa ka pa David tunga na khapsa a tungsah pa na hi hi. Na kam tawh thu na gen a, na khut tawh tuni-in na tangtungsah tahtah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel Pasien Topa aw, ama tungah thu ciemin, ‘Nang in ka thu na man bangin na suonlehlahte in ka thukham sungah kalsuon in a gamtat a kidop nah uleh ka mai-a Israel kumpi topha tungah a to ding mi khat zong na kitasam sih ding hi,’ na cisa bangin na nasempa ka pa David tunga na thuciemsa hing sudet in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel Pasien Topa aw, na nasempa David tunga na ciemsa kammal hing kipsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ahi vangin leitungah mihing tawh Pasien ang tengton tahtah ding amah? Vantung le a sangpen vantung nangawnin nang ang dawl sih hi. Tami keima lamsa biehinn bang a ci neu ta zang diei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na nasempa’ thumna le tauna thudon inlen, Topa ka Pasien aw, nangma mai-a nasempa ang kikona le ang thungetna ngaipieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na nasempa in tami mun lam nga-in ang thumna na zah thei nadingin na min a opna dinga na ciemsa mun tami biehinn lam sun le zanin ei en in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in tami mun lam nga-in thu ang nget ciengun na nasempa le na mi Israel’ ang thumna ngai in; na tenna van panin ei za inlen, na zah ciengin ei ngaidam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mi khat a vengte tungah a maw ziehin a kiciem ding a poimaw a, ama pei-in tami biehinn sung na maitam mai-ah ang kiciem leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />nangma in van panin hing za-in hing sem inlen, nangma’ nasemte thukhenin a khielte a gamtatna bangun amau’ luzang ma-ah tusahin hing thuh inlen, a thumante zong amau’ thumanna tawh kizui-in thaman piehna tawh kilangsah pai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nangma tungah na mi Israel ang maw ziehin a galte mai-ah guol lelin, ahi vangin amate na kungah hing kihei kia-in, na min hing phawhin tami biehinn sungah thumna le tauna ang nei ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />nangma in van panin za inlen, na mi Israel’ mawna ngaidamin, amate le a pu a pate na piehsa leitangah amate peipikia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Na tungah ang maw ziehun vantung kikha cipin guo a zuh lo hun, amate na gawt hun ciengin tami mun lam nga-in thu ngenin, na min hing phawhin a mawna uh panin a kihei uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />amau’ zui ding lampi hoi na hil ciengin van panin za-in na nasem, na mi Israel’ mawna ngaidam in; tuale na mite tungah gou-a na piehsa na gam sungah guo zusah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Gam sungah kiel ang tun a, pul natna, ankung natna, ankung maibuoh na, kauphe ahi sihle pangangte ang omin; a galte un a tenna khuopi uh khat penpenah imtawmin, bangbang gimna, bangbang natna ang tun leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />mimal khat in ahi a, na mi Israel zosie in ahi zongin a natna ule a dana ciet uh thei-in tami biehinn lamah a khut uh zahin bangbang thungetna ahi a, bangbang thumna ahi zongin ang bawl uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />na tenna van panin za-in ngaidam inlen, amau’ gamtatna tawh kizui-in nangma in a lungsim uh na thei bangin bawlpieh in, azieh pen nangma beh in mihing’ lungsim na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tam bang hileh amate in ka pu ka pate uh tunga na piehsa leitang tungah a ten sung tungtawnun nangma hing zatahin na thu ang zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tua ma bangin mun gamlapi panin na mi Israel ahi lo gamdang mite hing pei-in, a lien mama na min, na khut thahat le a kizah na ban ziehin tami biehinn lam nga-in thu ang nget ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />nangma in na tenna van panin hing za-in na kungah tua gamdang mite in ang nget popo bawlpieh in. Tua hile na mi Israel ma bangin leitung mi zosie in na min thei-in ang ging ding vua, amate in keima lamsa tami biehinn zong nangma’ min tawh kilo ahina ang thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Galte sim dingin na mite kuon khie-in, bang lam bang lamah sawl ta lateh, nangma teelsa tami khuopi, le na min tawh ka lamsa tami biehinn lam nga-in amate in thu ang nget uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />van panin amau’ thungetna le thumna za-in amau’ vai panpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Mihing a maw lo koima a op lo ziehin, amate na tungah ang maw vua, amate tungah nang lungthahin galte khut sungah amate pie-in, a gamla-ah hile a nai-ah hile amate galmatin kikai-in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />tua ciengin a kimatna gam sungah kisiakia a, ‘Kote maw-in ka gamta khiel zo ta uhi; ka gitlo tat ta uhi,’ ci-in na kungah ang thum uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />amate in galmat-a a opna uh leitangah a lungsim zosie ule a tahsa zosie utawh kisiakia-in, na teelsa khuopi le na min tawh ka lamsa biehinn, nangma in a pu a pate uh tunga na piehsa ahi a leitang lam uh nga-in thu ang nget uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />na tenna van panin amau’ thungetna le ang thumnate uh za inlen, a vai uzong panpi-in na tunga ang maw na mite ngaidam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Ka Pasien aw, tu-in na mit hahsah inlen, tami mun pana thungetna na bil ei ngat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Tu-in dingto-in, Topa Pasien aw, na khawlna ding munah nang le na thahatna singkuong tawh pei in. Topa Pasien aw, na siempute hutdamna puon tawh kivon uh hinlen, na hoina-ah na thuman mite kipah uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Topa Pasien aw, na sathau nu pa nuol sin. Na nasempa David tunga na itna kip khu phawh gige in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon a thunget a man ciengin vantung panin meikuong peisuhin meihal biehna le biehpiehnate katum hi; tuale biehinnpi sungah Topa’ minthanna vang a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn sungah Topa’ minthanna a dim ziehin Topa’ biehinn sungah siempute a lut thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mite zosie in meikuong ang kumsuh le Topa’ minthanna biehinn tung sontah ah a op a mu ciengun suongpha tungah lei lam nga-in a kunsuh vua, tuaci’n Pasien bie-in Topa tungah lungdam a ko vua, “Ama hoi hi, azieh pen ama itna kip tawntung hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa mai-ah kumpipa le mi zosie in biehpiehna a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpi Solomon in biehpiehna dingin bawngtang tul sawmni le tulni, le tuu tul zakhat le tul sawmni a pie hi. Tuaci’n kumpipa le mi zosie in Pasien’ biehinn a ap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siempute amau’ mun cietah a ding uhi; Levi-te zong, Kumpi David in Topa tungah lungdam ko nadinga a bawl Topa tunga tum thei vante tawh a ding uhi. Azieh pen ama’ itna kip tawntung hi. David in amau’ nasepnate tawh phatnate a pieh sielin tua bangin a bawl uhi. Amate tawh kigalsai-in siempute in pengkul a mut uhi; tuale Israel mi zosie a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon in Topa’ biehinn mai-a om leituol laikim siensuo hi; bang ding ahei cile Solomon in a bawl sumngo maitam ah meihal biehna, le an tawh biehna le a thau pawlkhat ta lo ahi ziehin tua munah ama in meihal biehnate le thunuom biehna thaute a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin Solomon in ni sagi sung pawi bawl a, Israel zosie ama tawh om tonin, a kikhawm mihon tampite, Lebo-hamath panin Egypt Lui cieng dong a dim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in a ni giet ni-in kikhopna thupi khat a nei uhi; azieh pen amate in maitam apna ni sagi sung a zang vua, pawi ni sagi sung a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hla sagina a ni sawmni le thumna ni-in, Topa in David le Solomon, le ama’ mi Israel tungah a hoina a lah ziehin, ama in lungdamna le kipahna tawh mipite a peisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua bangin Solomon in Topa’ biehinn le kumpi inn lam man sieng hi; Solomon in Topa’ biehinn sung le ama’ inn sungah sep dinga a gel zosie lawcing tahin a man sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin zan lai-in Solomon kungah Topa kilah a, ama kungah, “Na thungetna ka za zo ta a, keima’ biehpiehna inn dingin tami mun ka teel zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in guo a zuh lo nadingin van kot ka kha cieng hile leitang netum dinga kauphe thu ka pieh cieng hile ka mite lahah natna ka tunsah cieng hile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />keima’ min tawh a kilo ka mite, amahaw mama ang kiniemkhiehin, thu ngenin ka mai ang sui vua, a gitlo gamtatnate panun ang kihei uleh, keima in vantung panin za-in a mawna uh maisahin a gam uh ka damsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in mit hahin tam muna kingen thungetna ka bil ka ngat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tu-in khum munah a tawntungin ka min a op thei nadingin tami biehinn teelin ka siensuo zo ta hi; khum munah ka mit le ka lungsim a om zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang adingin ahile na pa David gamtat bangin keima mai-ah na gamtat a, kang sawl zosie bangin semin, ka thukhamte le ka biehna ngaina kipte na zui leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />na pa David tawh kiciemin, ‘Israel a uh ding mi na kitasam ngai sih ding hi,’ ka na ci ma bangin na kumpi topha kang kipsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin note kihei-in na mai-a ka koi ka thukhamte le ka thupiehnate nuasie-in, note pei-in pasien dangte’ na semin tuate na bieh uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />keima in note kang piehsa leitang panin note kang botzuon ding hi; tuale ka min dinga ka siensuosa tami biehinn zong ka muna panin sepmangin mi zosie lahah paunah le thugentena ka suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu-a a kitawisang tami biehinn tawh kisai-in, a gei a nawhkha poma in lamdangsa-in, ‘Bang dinga Topa in tam gam le tam biehinn a ci bawl a ta diei?’ ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in, ‘Bangzieh ahei cile amate in Egypt gam pana a peipi a pu a pate uh’ Pasien Topa a nuasie vua, pasien dangte pomin, tuate bie-in a na a sem uhi; tua ahi ziehin ama in amate tungah tam sietna zosie a tungsah hi,’ ci ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon in Topa’ biehinn le ama’ inn a lam zaw kum sawmni a cin ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huram in ama tunga a pieh khuopite Solomon in lamkia a, tuate sungah Israel mite tengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hamath-zobah ah Solomon pei-in tua gam a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in senel gam sungah Tadmor khuo sat a, Hamath gam sungah vankholna khuopi zosie a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in kul tawh ki-im khuopite, tunkotte, le kotgolte a nei Beth-horon Tungnung le Beth-horon Neinung zong lam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Baalath le Solomon’ vankholna khuopi zosie zong, a leengte koina khuopi zosie, a sakol galkapte ading khuopite, le Solomon in Jerusalem, Lebanon, le ama uhna gam sung zosie-ah a lam nop zosie a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel ahi lo Hit-te, Amor-te, Periz-te, Hiv-te, le Jebus-te sung pan a omlai teng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mite in a suhsiet nai lo amau’ suonlehlahte sung panin tua gam sunga a omlai teng- tam teng pen Solomon in thona-aana sem dinga a khon mite ahi vua, tua bangin amate tuni dongin a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanle Solomon in a nasepna-ah Israel mite salin bawl lo hi; amate pen galkapte, le ama nei-a uliente, a leeng galkap makaite, le a sakol galkap makaite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam teng pen mite tunga aana a zang Kumpi Solomon’ ulien zani le sawmnga-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomon in David’ khuopi panin ama adinga a lam inn ah Pharaoh’ tanu peipi hi, azieh pen ama in, “ Topa’ singkuong a tunnasa munte a siengtho ahi ziehin Israel Kumpi David’ inn sungah ka zi teng thei lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in talaap mai-a a lam Topa’ maitam tungah Solomon in Topa tungah meihal biehnate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses’ thupiehna tawh kizui-in sabbath nite, hladet nite, kum sima kibawl pawi thumte- tol kisaw lo anlum pawi, nipikal pawi, buh pawite le nisima a kisam bangin Topa tungah biehpiehnate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in a pa David’ biehna ngaina kip tawh kizui-in amau’ sep nading munah siempute a pawlpawlin se a, nisim nasepna-ah a kisam bangin Levi-te phatna lasah nasep le a tuonvai nasep a sem dingin siempute tawh kithuosah a, ama in kotpi tuomtuomte dingin kotcingte amau’ pawl kikhenna cietah se hi; azieh pen tua bangin David in Pasien’ mipa thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levi-te le siempute in thu khat popo le vanmanphate koina tawh kisai-in kumpipa thupiehna panin a lam piel sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua bangin Topa’ biehinn bulpi a kiphu ni-a kipanin Topa’ biehinnpi a kiman sieng dongin Solomon’ nasep ding zosie kiman sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Solomon in Edom gam sung tuipi gei-a om Ezion-geber le Eloth-te a va pha ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huram in ama kungah a tembawte le tuipi thu a thei a nasemte a sawl hi. Solomon’ nasemte tawh Ophir ah amate a zawhton vua, khum panin kham talent zali le sawmnga puo-in Kumpi Solomon kung a tunpi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sheba kumpinu in Solomon’ minthan na a zah ciengin thudawhna hamsate tawh Solomon zelah dingin Jerusalem ah haw a, ama in nuazui honpi le a namtui nate, kham tampi le suongmanpha a puo kalaohte a keng hi. Solomon kungah ama nu a tun ciengin a lungsim sunga om zosie ama tawh a kikum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in tua nu thudawh zosie a dawng hi; tua nu kungah Solomon in a gencien thei lo hahsa luo a sah thu bangma om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sheba kumpinu in Solomon’ pilna, a lamsa a inn a lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a sabuoi-a kilui neh le tahte, vaihawm uliente’ tona, le a nasemte’ kep le khoi dan, a puonsil a nihtente uh, a an piete, le Topa’ inn sunga a meihal biehnate a mu ciengin, tua nu ciza lia-in a hla tawh zong a teng nawn va-ia sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n tua nu in kumpipa kungah, “Ka gam sung pana ka zah na sepnate le na pilna ang kigente a man vive ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ahi vangin keima hing pei-in ka mit in a mu masangsie a kigen thute ka tahsang sih hi. Na pilna a lietzie alang nangawn zong ka kungah ang kigen nai sih hi; ka thuzahte sangin na thupizaw tham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na mite mi nuomsa ahi uhi! Nang ang khoi zing a, na pilna thu a za zing na nasemte zong mi nuomsa ahi uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na tungah lungkimin, Topa na Pasien adingin kumpi dinga ama’ kumpi topha tunga ang tosah Topa na Pasien in thupha nga taheh! Na Pasien in Israel it a, a tawntungin amate kipsah ding ahi ziehin, thutang le thuman na sep thei nadingin ama in amate tungah nang kumpi ang suohsah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua nu in kumpipa tungah kham talent za le sawmni, le gimnamtui tampitah le suong manphate a pie hi: Solomon kumpipa tunga Sheba kumpinu in a pieh tua banga a gimnamtui om ngai nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua tham loin Ophir panin kham a puo Huram’ nasemte le Solomon’ nasemte in cingsing le suong manphate zong a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn le kumpi inn kaleite bawl nadingin kumpipa in cingsingte zang a, lasate ading lyre-te le harp-te bawl nadingin zong zang hi; tua hun masangin Judah gam sungah tua bangte kimu ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khum hun sungin Sheba kumpinu’ dei nget zosie Kumpi Solomon in pie a, kumpipa kunga a pieh za sanga a tamzaw a pie hi. Tua ciengin a nasemte tawh a gamah tua nu a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kum khat sungin Solomon tunga kipuoh kham a gihna talent zaguh le sawmguh le guh pha a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuate banah sumbawlte le sumbuhte’ puohte kisim nai lo hi; tuale Arabia kumpite le gam uhpate zosie in Solomon tungah kham le ngunte a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpi Solomon in a kikheng kham tawh lum a gol zani bawl hi; lum a gol khat bawl nadingin kham shekel zaguh tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a kikheng kham lum zathum bawl hi; lum khat ciengin kham shekel zathum ta tawp hi; tuale kumpipa in Lebanon Tulah Inn sungah tua lumte koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa in saiha tawh kumpi topha golpi khat zong bawl a, kham citah tawh a zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpi topha in kalei ciel guh le kham tawh a kibawl kengngapna khat nei-in, tuate pen Kumpi topha tawh kimat a, a tona pang tuohah ban ngapnate le a ban ngahnate pangah humpi ni ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />kalei ciel guh mong cietah khat ciet, humpi sawm le ni ding hi. Kumpi gam khatpo-ah tua tawh a kibang kibawl ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumpi Solomon’ tuidawnna hai zosie a unpi-in kham citah tawh kibawl hi a, tuale Lebanon Tulah Inn sunga vanzah zosie a unpi-in kham citah tawh kibawl vive ahi hi; Solomon hun lai-in ngun bangma-in a kisim sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Azieh pen kumpipa’ tembawte Huram’ nasemte tawh Tarshish ah a pei uhi; kum thum sielin Tarshish tembawte khatvei tungin kham, ngun, saiha, zawngkute, le utongte puoh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua bangin kumpi Solomon in a hauna le a pilna tawh leitung kumpi zosie sangin a tungtuongzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pasien in a lungsim sunga a guot ama’ pilna ngai dingin leitung mi zosie in Solomon’ opna a leisui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama kunga a haw zosie in letsong, ngun le kham tawh a kibawl nate, puonsilte, galvante, gimnamtuite, sakolte, laa-sakolte, kum sielin tampi a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomon in sakolte le leengte koina buh tulli, le sakol tul sawm le tulni nei a, tuate leeng khuopite sungah koi a, Jerusalem khuo-a ama kungah zong koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in Euphrates panin Philistia gam cieng dong, le Egypt gamgi cieng dong kumpi zosie uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa in Jerusalem ah suongpem bangin ngun tamsah a, tuale Shephelah theitheh sing bangin taamtah sing zong a vausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Solomon adingin Egypt gam le gam zosie panin sakolte kila hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tu-in Solomon gamtatna a omlai teng, a patna panin a tawpna dong, Kamsang Nathan’ Tangthu sung, le Shiloh-te Ahijah’ Thugen Kholna sung, le Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam thu tawh kisai-in Thumu pa Iddo’ Mangmuna sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Solomon in Jerusalem ah Israel zosie kum sawmli sung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Solomon lumton a, a pa David’ khuopi sungah kivui hi; tuale a tapa Rehoboam in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shechem ah Rehoboam a pei hi, azieh pen ama kumpi suohsah dingin Israel zosie a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam in tua thu a zah ciengin (azieh pen Kumpi Solomon kung pan a taina Egypt ah ama omlai hi), Egypt panin Jeroboam a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in mi sawlin ama a hlansah uhi; tuale Jeroboam le Israel zosie pei-in Rehoboam kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na pa in ka hahkol uh a gihsah hi. Tua ahi ziehin tu-in na pa’ nasep hamsate le ko tunga ei suon a hahkol gihte hing zangsah in, tua hile kote in nangma’ na ka sem ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Ni thum sungin keima kungah hing peikia un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n mite a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Rehoboam in zong a pa Solomon hin lai-a ama a kem khanghamte thu kuppi a, “Tam mite ka dawnna ding ngaisutna ei bangci pieh ding na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “Nang in tam mite khuotuo-in amate lungkimsahin kam hoi gen po lacin, a tawntungin na nasemte ang hi zing ta ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanle ama in khangham upate pieh ngaisutna nuol a, ama tawh a khangton, tulaitaha ama a kem khangnote thu a kuppi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “’Na pa in ko tunga ang suon hahkol zangsah in,’ ei ci mite i dawn thei nadingin bang ngaisutna ei pie ding na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama tawh a khangton tangvalte in ama kungah, “Nangma kungah, ‘Na pa in ka hahkol uh gihsah hi, ahi vangin nang in ko adingin tua hahkol hing zangsah in,’ ang ci mite kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi, ‘Ka pa’ kawng sangin ka khutme a sazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in keima in ka pa ang suon vangih kang belap lai ding hi. Ka pa in khauhuol tawh ang sat vua, ahi vangin keima in cieng lingneite tawh kang sat ding hi,’ na ci ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in, “Ni thum ni-in ka kungah hing peikia un,” a ci ma bangin Rehoboam kungah Jeroboam le mi zosie a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa in amate na khauh dawn mama hi. Kumpi Rehoboam in khanghamte’ ngaisutna a nuol hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ama in khangnote’ ngaisutna bangin amate kungah thu gen a, “Ka pa in no tunga vangih ang suon pen kang belap zaw lai ding hi; ka pa in khauhuol tawh note thu ang hil hi, ahi vangin keima in cieng lingneite tawh thu kang hil ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in mite’ thu a ngai sih hi. Azieh pen tami khu Topa in Shiloh-te Ahijah tungtawnin Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam tungah a gensa thu a tangtun nadinga Topa piensah thukawng kiheina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa in amau’ thu ngai lo hi, ci Israel mi zosie in a mu bepun, mite in kumpipa dawngin, David sungah kote in bang tanh ka nei uh ahei? Jessi tapa sungah gouluo ka nei sih uhi. Israel aw, na puonbuh cietah pei un! a ci uhi. Tuaci’n Israel zosie in a puonbuh ciet a zuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin Judah gam khuopite sunga a teng Israel mite tungah Rehoboam a maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpi Rehoboam in Israel mite kungah thona-aana nasepna a uhpa Hadoram a sawl ciengin, amate in ama suong tawh na seplia uhi. Jerusalem-a tai dingin a leeng tungah Kumpipa Rehoboam a naw tuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel in tuni dongin David’ innsung mite a ledo uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem ah Rehoboam a tun ciengin ama in Rehoboam’ kumpi gam a ngakia nadingin Israel sim dingin Judah minam le Benjamin minam teeltuom galkap mi tul zakhat le tul sawmgiet kaikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien’ mi Shemaiah tungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah kumpi Solomon’ tapa Rehoboam, le Judah le Benjamin gam sunga om Israel mi zosie kungah gen in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: “Note na kuonto sih ding vua, na sanggamte na sim sih ding uhi. Mi zosie a inn lam ciet vuah kilekia ta uheh. Bang ding ahei cile tam thu khu keima kung pan ahi hi. Tuaci’n Topa’ thu mangin Jeroboam do nading panin amate a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem ah Rehoboam teng a, kidal nadingin ama in Judah gam sungah khuopite a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Bethlehem, Etam, Tekoa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Beth-zur, Soco, Adullam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gath, Mareshah, Ziph,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Adoraim, Lachish, Azekah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zorah, Aijalon, le Hebron, Judah le Benjamin gam sunga om kulnei khuopite a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in gal kulpite dettahin bawl a, tuate sungah galkapmangte koi-in an, sathau le lenggazu a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in khuopi zosie-ah lum le tei golte koi a, tua khuopite a muonhuoi-in a bawl hi. Tuaci’n ama in Judah gam le Benjamin gam kem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amau’ tenna ciet panin Israel gam sung zosie-a om siempute le Levi-te ama kungah a kila uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi-te in a taang gamte ule a neisate uh nuasie siengin Judah le Jerusalem ah a pei uhi. Azieh pen Jeroboam le a tapate in Topa’ siempu hina panin amate khawlsah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />munsangte, kel-dawite, le a bawlsa bawngno milimte adingin ama’ siempute koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel Topa Pasien sui ding a lunglut mite in a pu a pate uh’ Pasien, Topa tungah biehpiehna pie dingin Israel minam zosie sung panin a nua uh zui-in Jerusalem ah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in Judah kumpi gam a thahatsah vua, Solomon’ tapa Rehoboam kum thum sung bihtahin a omsah uhi. Azieh pen amate in David le Solomon’ lampi kum thum sung a tawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rehoboam in David’ tapa Jerimoth’ tanu Mahalath zi-in la a, a nu Jessi’ tapa Eliab’ tanu Abihail ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua nu in ama tawh tapate, Jeush, Shemariah, le Zaham nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua nu zaw ciengin ama in Absalom’ tanu Maacah la a, ama tawh Abijah, Attai, Ziza, le Shelomith nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehoboam in a zi dangte zosie le a mei teng sangin Absalom’ tanu Maacah a itzaw hi. (ama in zi sawm le giet le mei sawmguh nei a, tapa sawmni le giet le tanu sawmguh’ pa a suoh hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rehoboam in kumpi-in ama a koi sawm ziehin a sanggamte lahah Maacah’ tapa Abijah ulien penin koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pilvang tahin ama vaihawm a, Judah le Benjamin gam sung teng zosie, kulpi nei khuopi zosie sungah a tapa kimkhat a hawmkhen hi; ama in an neh ding tampitah pie a, amate adingin zi zong a suipieh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboam’ uhna kipin ama a thahat ciengin, ama le a ompi Israel zosie in Topa’ thukham a nuasie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa tungah amate a citah lo ziehun Kumpi Rehoboam’ a kum ngana kumin Jerusalem sim dingin Egypt Kumpi Shishak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />leeng galkap tul le zani, le sakol galkap tul sawmguh tawh a kuonto hi. Egypt pana ama tawh a kuonton galkapte ahile a tam dan uh kisim zo lo hi- amate pen Libya-te, Sukki-te, le Ethiopia-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Judah gama kulnei khuopite la-in Jerusalem cieng dong a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Shishak ziehin Jerusalem-a a kikhawm Rehoboam le Judah uliente kungah kamsang Shemaiah pei-in amate kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Note in kei nei nuasie uhi. Tuaci’n ken zong Shishak’ khut sungah note kang nuasie ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel uliente le kumpipa a kiniemkhieh vua, tuaci’n amate in, “ Topa a thuman hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in amau’ kiniemkhieh lam a mu bepin Shemaih kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi: “Amate a kiniemkhieh zo ta uhi; hizongle amate susie loin ka hunkhie lieiliei tei ding a, Shishak’ khut tungtawnin Jerusalem tungah ka lungthahna kisungsuh lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in keima’ nasepna le gamdang kumpi gamte’ nasepna a kilamdanna a theithei nadingun amate pen ama’ nasemte a suoh ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jerusalem sim dingin Egypt Kumpipa Shishak a kuonto hi; ama in Topa’ biehinn sunga goute le kumpipa’ inn sunga goute a kipan na zosie a lamang sieng hi; ama in Solomon’ bawlsa kham lumte zong a lamang sieng hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hinanle Kumpi Rehoboam in tuate tangin sumngo lum bawl a, kumpipa’ kotcing ahi inncing uliente’ khut sungah tuate ap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn sungah kumpipa a lut sielin a cingte pei-in tuate puo-in a cingte’ innkhan sungah a koikia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama a kiniemkhieh ziehin amate a suhsiet cip lo nadingin ama kung panin Topa’ lungthahna a kiheimang hi; tua tham loin, Judah gam sungah thu peizie zong hoi pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n Kumpi Jerusalem ah Rehoboam amama kisukipin a maang hi. Rehoboam a maan kipatin kum sawmni le khat pha hi; Israel minamte sung panin Topa in ama’ min koi nadinga a teel Jerusalem ah ama kum sawm le sagi sung maang hi. Ama’ min pen Naamah hi a, Ammon-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in Topa sui ding a lungsim sungah a koi lo ziehin a sie-in a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in Rehoboam’ gamtatna teng, a kipatna pan a tawpna dong, Kamsang Shemaiah le Thumu pa Iddo’ Khang Tangthu sungah kigiel hi lo amah? Rehoboam le Jeroboam kikalah kidona om den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Rehoboam lumton a, David’ khuopi sungah kivui hi; tuale a tapa Abijah in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Jeroboam a maan kum sawm le gietna kumin Judah tungah Abijah maan ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Jerusalem ah kum thum sung maang hi. Ama nu’ min Micaiah hi a, Gibeah-te Uriel’ tanu ahi hi. Tu-in Abijah le Jeroboam kilalah kidona a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gal sim dingin Abijah kuon a, a kituomteel mi zali a pha, a thahat galhang galkap hon a nei hi. A kituomteel a thahat galhang tul zagiet tawh Abijah do dingin Jeroboam a pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ephraim muoltung gama om Zemaraim Muol tungah Abijah ding a, “Jeroboam le Israel zosie aw, ka thu ngai un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel Pasien Topa in ci tawh kibawl thuciemna tawh Israel tunga kumpi sem den dingin David le a tapate tungah a pieh lam thei lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hizongle David’ tapa Solomon’ nasempa, Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam kipanin a pu a ledo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuale Rehoboam pen khangno lai a, thukhentat thei nai loin amate a nan zo lo hun laitahin, a kimvelah kimanna a nei lo mi ginalo honkhat kikhawmin Solomon’ tapa Rehoboam a dem bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Note in mi tampi na hi zieh ule Jeroboam in na pasien ding vua ang bawlpieh kham bawngnote na nei ziehun, tu-in David tapate’ khut sunga om Topa’ kumpi gam do na sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aaron’ suonte ahi Topa’ siempute, le Levi-te delmangin gamdang mite bawl bang ma-in noma dingin siempute bawltawm hi lo na hi uh amah? Bawngtangno khat ahi sihle tuutang sagi tawh a kisiensuo dinga a pei popo pasien ahi lote’ siempu suoh paipai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin kote adingin ahile, Topa pen ka Pasien uh ahi a, ama ka nuasie sih uhi. Topa’ na a sem Aaron’ suon siempute le amau’ nasep a hu dingin Levi-te ka nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in zingmawng le nitah sielin Topa tungah meihal biehnate le a gim namtuite a pie vua, kham citah tawh a kibawl sabuoi tungah anlum guolte lui-in, nitah sielin a meivahte a kuon siem nadingin kham meivah tunna a kem hoi uhi; bangzieh ahei cile kote in Topa ka Pasien’ ei sawlna ka zui vua, ahi vangin note in ama na nuasie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />En un, ka makai dingun kote tawh Topa ang omton a, note do dinga gal hlatna pengkul tum dingin ama’ siempute in galkap pengkulte a nei uhi. Israel-te aw, na pu na pate uh’ Pasien, Topa do sih un; azieh pen na zo vawt sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jeroboam in a nua lam panun a buhdap dingte a sawl hi; tua bangin Judah masangah a galkapte om a, a nua lam vuah a buhdapte a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah a kihei ciengin ama in a galte a nua a ma-ah a op lam a mu hi. Topa kungah amate a kiko vua, siempute in pengkul a mut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah mite in zong galdona aw a kiko uhi. Judah mite a kiko ciengun Abijah le Judah mai-ah Pasien in Jeroboam le Israel mi zosie a zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Judah mai-ah Israel-te a taimang vua, Pasien in a khut sung vuah amate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abijah le a galkapte in amate zogawpin mi tampi a that uhi; a kituomteel Israel mi tul zanga kithat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua bangin a pu a pate uh’ Pasien, Topa tungah amate a kingap ziehun Judah mite a guol zo vua, Israel-te in tua hunin gal a lel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abijah in Jeroboam nuadel a, ama kung panin khuopite, Bethel a khuoneute tawh, Jeshanah a khuoneute le Ephron a khuoneute tawh a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeroboam in Abijah’ hun sungin vang nei zo nawn lo hi; Topa in ama vatin ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin Abijah a thahat tehteh hi. Ama in zi sawm le li la a, tapa sawmni le ni le tanu sawm le guh’ pa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abijah’ gamtatna a omlai teng, ama ziete le a thugente, Kamsang Iddo’ Tangthu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaci’n Abijah si-in a pu a pate tawh lumton a, amate in David’ khuopi-ah ama a vui uhi. A tapa Asa in ama’ zaluo hi. Ama’ uh sungin a gam sungah kum sawm sung gal a veng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asa in Topa a Pasien’ muna-ah a hoi le a manin na sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in gamdang maitamte, munsangte, le biehna songte satpua-in khuom siengthote phua a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a pu a pate’ Pasien, Topa sui-in thukham le thupiehnate a zui nadingun Judah thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Judah khuopi zosie panin munsangte le gimnamtui maitamte zong hemkhie hi. Tuale ama’ khut nei-ah kumpi gam sung gal a veng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A gam sungah gal a dai hun sungin ama in Judah gam sungah kulpi nei khuopite a lam hi. Topa in ama tungah kilemna hun a pieh ziehin khum hun sungin ama in gal a nei kha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Judah kungah, “Tam khuopite lamin kulpite le tausangte, kul kotpite le zawlte tawh im vai. Topa i Pasien i sui ziehun leitang pen eite’ gam ahi lai hi; eite in ama i sui vua, ama in zong i kim zosie-ah kilemna ei pie hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in zong khuopi lamin a khangto uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asa in Judah gam sung panin lum gol le teipi tawh kivon galkap tul zathum, le lum le thal a tawi Benjamin galkap hon tul zani le tul sawmgiet nei hi; tam teng zosie pen a thahat galhangte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate a sim dingin galkap awn khat le leeng galkap zathum tawh Ethiopia-te Zerah kuonin Mareshah cieng dong tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama tawh kimu dingin Asa kuonkhie a, Marashah-a Zephathah guom-ah gal kido dingin amate in panmun a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa a Pasien’ tungah Asa kiko a, “ Topa aw, a thahat le a thanemte kikalah na panpi ding pen nang adingin a kilamdanna a om sih hi. Kote ei hu in, Topa kohaw’ Pasien aw. Nangma kang muon ziehun nangma’ minin tam mihonpi a do dingin kang pei zo ta uhi. Topa aw, nang, kohaw’ Pasien na hi hi; mihing in kizosah vawt sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in Asa le Judah mite mai-ah Ethiopia-te zo a, Ethiopia-te a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asa le ama tawh a omton galkapte in Gerar cieng dongah amate a nuadel vua, Ethiopia-te koima a hing om loin a puamat sieng uhi; azieh pen Topa le a galkapte mai-ah amate kisusie hi. Judah mite in van kinuasie tampitah a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate tungah Topa zatahna a tun ziehin Gerar kimvela om khuopi zosie a zo uhi. Amate in khuopi teng a bulu uhi; azieh pen tua khuopite sungah van kinuasie tampitah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in ganhon neite’ puonbuhte zong simin tuu le keel, le kalaoh tampi a peipi uhi. Tua ciengin Jerusalem ah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Obed’ tapa Azariah tungah Pasien’ hlagau a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asa tawh kimu dingin ama pusuohin ama kungah, “Asa, Judah le Benjamin-te zosie aw, ka thugen ngai un. Ama tawh na om laisie uh note tawh Topa ang om hi. Ama na sui uleh ama na mu ding vua, ahi vangin ama na nuasie uleh ama in zong note ang nuasie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hun sawtveipi sung Israel-te, Pasien man tawh om lo, thuhil siempu tawh om loin, thukham tawh zong omlo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate a lungkham ciengun Israel Pasien, Topa lamah kihei-in ama a sui vua, tuaci’n ama a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in amate a zinsuh a zinto na vuah lungmuonna a om sih hi, bangzieh ahei cile gamcin tenga a teng mi zosie tungah buoina lienpi a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien in lungkhamna namcin tawh a buoisah ziehin minam khat le minam khat, khuopi khat le khuopi khat a kido vua, a nengnengin a kikhenthang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanle nang na hi leh hang in! Na nasepna thaman ang kipie ding ahi ziehin na khut zawsah sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asa in Oded’ tapa Azariah’ genkhol na ahi tam thute a zah ciengin ama hangsanin, Judah gam zosie le Benjamin le Ephraim muoltung gam pana a lahsa khuopite panin a kidahhuoi milimte paimang a, Topa’ biehinn talaap mai-a Topa’ maitam a puopha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in Judah le Benjamin-te zosie, le Ephraim, Manasseh, le Simeon sung panin amate kunga a peem gamdang mite a kaikhawm hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa a Pasien in ama tawh a opna thu a mu ciengun Israel panin ama kungah mi tampi a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asa’ uh kum sawm le ngana a hla thumna sungin Jerusalem ah amate a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ni-in gal sunga a puoh uh nate sung panin Topa tungah bawngtang zasagi le tuu tulsagi tawh biehpiehna a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A lungsim zosie ule a hinna zosie utawh a pu a pate uh’ Pasien, Topa a sui nadingun kiciemna khat a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel Pasien, Topa a sui lo poma, a khang hile, a teh hile, pasal hile, numei hile kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Awsangpi tawh a kiko kawmun amate in pengkul le sakite tumin Topa tungah kiciemna a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua kiciemna-ah Judah mi zosie a kipah uhi; bangzieh ahei cile a lungsim zosie utawh amate kiciemin a deina zosie utawh ama a sui vua, amate in ama mu-in, Topa in zong a kimvel vuah galvenna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nu Maacah in Asherah adingin a kidahhuoi milim khat a bawl ziehin kumpi Asa in a nu nangawn kumpipa’ nu hina za panin a hemkhie hi. Asa in a nu’ milim sattanin suguoi a, Kidron Lui-ah a haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel panin munsangte a kilakhietuon sih hi. Hizongle a uh hun sung tungtawnin Asa’ lungsim a thuman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in pieh dinga a pa in a na ciemsa letsongte le ama’ na ciemsa letsongte - ngun le kham, le vanzahte, Pasien’ biehinn sungah a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asa in a uh kum sawmthum le ngana cieng dong galkidona om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Asa a maan kum sawmthum le guhna kumin Judah sim dingin Israel Kumpipa Baasha kuonto a, Judah Kumpipa Asa’ gam sungah koima a pusuoh a sungtum a op thei lo nadingin ama in Ramah khuo a sat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Asa in Topa’ inn le kumpipa’ inn sunga goute sung panin ngun le khamte la-in, Damascus-a teng Aram Kumpipa Ben-hadad kungah tuate hlah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Na pa le ka pa a kizop ma bangin nang le kei kikalah kizopna khat omsah vai. Ngun le kham kang hlah hi; kei kung panin ama a nuakin nadingin va pei ta’nlen Israel Kumpipa Baasha tawh na kizopna va phel ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ben-hadad in Kumpi Asa thugen mangin Israel khuopite sim dingin a galkapmangte sawl a, amate in Ijon, Dan, Abel-maim, le Naphtali vankholna khuopite a zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Baasha in tua thu a zah ciengin Ramah khuopi a lam khawl a, a nasep a tawpsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Asa in Judah mi zosie khawm a, amate in Baasha in Ramah lamna-a a zah suongte le a singte puo-in tuate tawh Geba le Mizpah a lam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Judah Kumpi Asa kungah thumu pa Hanani pei-in ama kungah, “Nangma in Aram kumpipa suongin Topa na Pasien suong lo na hi ziehin Aram kumpipa’ galkapte in nang ang suohtasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ethiopia-te le Libya-te zong khu leeng tampi le sakol galkap tampitah tawh a om galkap tampi hi lo amah? Ahi vangin Topa suong na hi ziehin ama in nangma’ khut sungah amate ang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama tungah a lungsim a man mite thahatsah dingin Topa’ mit in leitung zosie a en kawikawi hi. Tami thu-ah na mot tat zo ta hi; azieh pen tu-a kipanin gal na nei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin thumu pa tungah Asa lungthah a, ama kolbulin thong sungah a khum hi, azieh pen tam thu ziehin ama tungah a lungthah mama hi. Tuale khum hun sung ma-in Asa in mi kimkhat tungah gimna hamsapite a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asa’ gamtatnate, a patna panin a tawpna dong, Judah le Israel Kumpite’ Tangthu sungah kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama a maan a kum sawmthum le kuona kumin Asa in a kengah natna nei a, a natna nasie mama hi; hinanle a nat hun sung nangawnin ama in Topa a sui sih a, zato siemte’ panpina a suizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pu a pate tawh Asa lumton a, ama a maan zaw a kum sawmli le khatna kumin a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in David khuopi ah ama dinga a kibawlsa hankhuh sungah ama a vui uhi. Amate in panamtui bawl siem mite’ bawl a namtui tuomtuomte tawh a kidim hankuong sungah ama a siel uhi; tuale amate in ama zatahna-in tumphuol golpi khat a taw uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama’ tapa Jehoshaphat in a za luo a, Israel sim dingin amama a kithakhausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Judah gama kulpi nei khuopi zosie-ah galkapte koi a, Judah gam sung le a pa Asa in a lahsa Ephraim khuopite sungah khuopi cingte koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a pa’ gamtat masate a zui ziehin Topa in Jehoshaphat a ompi hi; ama in Baal pasien-te bie loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel-te’ tawndan bangin tawn a, a pa’ bieh Pasien sui-in a thupiehnate a zuizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in ama’ khut sungah kumpi gam a kipsah hi. Judah zosie in Jehoshaphat kungah sieh le kaihte a puoh vua, ama in neisa tampi le patawina nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa’ lampite ah a ama’ lungsim a hangsan hi; tua tham loin ama in Judah gam panin munsangte le khuom siengthote a hemkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama’ uh a kum thumna kumin ama in Judah gam khuopite sunga thuhil dingin a uliente Benhail, Obadiah, Zechariah, Nethanel, le Micaiah-te a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate tawh Levi mite Shemaiah, Nethaniah, Zebadiah, Asahel, Shemiramoth, Jehonathan, Adonijah, Tobijah, le Tob-adonijah a peiton uhi; tuale siempu Elishama le Jehoram zong tami Levi-te tawh a peiton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa’ thukham laibu kengin Judah gam sungah amate in thu a hil uhi; Judah khuopi zosie-ah amate pei kawikawi-in mite lahah thu a hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah gam kimvela om kumpi gam zosie tungah Topa zatahna tung a, tuale amate in Jehoshaphat a do nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Philistia-te pawlkhat in Jehoshaphat kungah letsongte, le sie le kaih dingin ngun a puoh uhi; tuale Arab-te in zong ama tungah tuutang tulsagi le zasagi, le keeltang tulsagi le zasagi a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Damdamin Jehoshaphat vanglien semsem hi. Ama in Judah gam sungah kulpite le vankholna khuopite a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Judah khuopite sungah nasep lienpite sem hi. Ama in Jerusalem-ah galkapte, a thahat galhangte a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pupate innkuon tawh kizui-in amate a phaza tam bang ahi hi. Judah sung pan a tula a uhte: Adah pen a uhpa ahi a, a thahat galhang mi tul zathum tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama’ zomah a uhpa Jehohanan ahi a, mi tul zani le tul sawmgiet tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama’ zomah Topa’ nasepna dinga kipumpieh Zichri’ tapa Amasiah ahi a, a thahat a galhang mi tul zani tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Benjamin sung panin: A thahat a galhang Eliada ahi a, thal le lum a tawi mi tul zani tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama’ zomah Jehozabad ahi a, galdo dinga hiem tawi mi tul zakhat le tul sawmgiet tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tam teng pen kumpipa in Judah gam sung zosie-ah kul nei khuopite-a a koite banah kumpipa’ na a semte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Jehoshaphat in hauna le minthanna nei hi; tuale ama in Ahab tawh kitenna zieha kizopna khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kum tawmvei zaw ciengin Samaria-a Ahab kunga haw dingin a kuonsuh hi. Ahab in ama ading le a zawpite adingin tuu tampi le bawngtang tampi gaw a, Ramoth-gilead simto dingin ama a zawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Ahab in Judah Kumpipa Jehoshaphat kungah, “Keima tawh Ramoth-gilead ah nang kuon diei mah?” ci hi. Ama in dawngin, “Nangma tawh a omton ka hi a, ka mite nangma’ mite ahi hi. Galsimna-ah nangma tawh kang kuon ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jehoshaphat in zong Israel kumpipa kungah, “ Topa’ thu dong masa in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel kumpipa in kamsangte zali kaikhawm a, tuale amate kungah, “Ramoth-gilead sim dingin ka kuonto diei, tua ahi sihle ka pel lel diei mah?” a ci hi. Amate in, “Kuonto in; azieh pen Pasien in kumpipa’ khut sungah ang pie ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jehoshaphat in, “Tam sungah thu i dawh thei ding Topa’ kamsang adang a om ta sih amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in Jehoshaphat kungah, “Thu i dawh thei ding Imlah’ tapa Micaiah a kici mi dangkhat omlai hi; ahi vangin ama in kei thu a hoi lamin a gen ngai sih a, gimna nading ngentang a gen ziehin ama ka muda hi,” a ci hi. Jehoshaphat in, “Kumpipa in tua bang mawh ci sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in a ulien khat hlan a, “Imlah’ tapa Micaiah mallangtahin hing peipi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu-in Israel kumpipa le Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat a kumpi topha tung vuah to-in puontuolpi silin a kizem uhi; tuale Samaria tunkot lutna mun ancilna phuol-ah amate a to uhi; tuale kamsang zosie in a mai vuah kam a sang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chenaanah’ tapa Zedekiah in sia sakite bawlin ama in, “ Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Amate a kisuhsiet masangsie tam teng tawh Aram-te na sun ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kamsang zosie in zong tua ma bangin kam a sang vua, “Ramoth-gilead ah kuonto inlen va zo ta’n; Topa in kumpipa’ khut sungah ang pie ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Micaiah hlan dinga a kuon kamtaipa in ama kungah, “En in, kithukhatin kamsangte’ gen khu kumpipa dinga a hoilam ahi hi; na thu gen zong amau’ gen tawh kibangsah inlen, a hoilamin gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Micaiah in, “ Topa a hing ahi ma bangin ka Pasien’ gen popo ka gen ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa kungah ama a tun ciengin kumpipa in ama kungah, “Micaiah aw, Ramoth-gilead ah galsim dingin ka kuonto diei, tua ahi sihle ka pel lel diei mah?” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Kuonto inlen va zo ta’n; na khut sungah amate ang kipie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanle kumpipa in ama kungah, “ Topa’ min tawh keima tungah thuman ci longal bangma dang nang gen lo nadingin bang zavei hing kiciemsah ding ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Micaiah in, “Tuucing om lo tuute bangin muolte tungah Israel mi zosie a kithethang ka mu hi. Tuale Topa in, ‘Tam mite in pu a nei sih uhi; a inn lam ciet vuah lungmuongin kilesah un,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in Jehoshaphat kungah, “Ama in kei thu a hoi lamin khat zong gen ngai loin gimna ding beh ang gen ding hi, ci-in na kungah kang gen tamal sih amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Micaiah in, “Tua ahi ziehin Topa’ thugen ngai vawi un: Topa a kumpi topha tungah to-in a ziet le a vei-ah van mihonpite a ding ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale Topa in, ‘Ramoth-gilead ah Israel kumpipa Ahab kuonto-in a si nadingin koi pen in ama va zawl ta ding ahei?’ a ci hi. Tua ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />hlagau khat madawhin Topa mai-ah ding a, ‘Keima in ama va zawl ta vang,’ a ci masangsie, khat in thu khat gen a, adang khat in thu tuom khat a gen hi. Topa in ama kungah, ‘Bang na ci zawl diei?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in dawngin, ‘Kei va pei-in a kamsang zosie’ kam sungah hlagau zuou khat ka va suoh ta ding hi,’ a ci hi. Tua ciengin Topa in, ‘Nangma in ama na va zawl ta ding a, na zo ding hi; pei inlen va sem in,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n en in, Topa in tami na kamsangte’ kam sungah hlagau zuou khat koi zo ta hi; Topa in nang adingin na thuoh ding gimna khensat zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Chenaanah’ tapa Zedekiah in zuon phei-a Micaiah pheta behin, “Nang tunga thu gen dingin Topa’ hlagau in bang lampi panin ei kalsan thei ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Micaiah in dawngin, “A kibu dingin innkhan sungnungah na pei ni ciengin na thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel kumpipa in thupie a, “Micaiah man unlen, khuopi uhpa Amon kung le kumpipa’ tapa kungah zawpikia un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuale ama in, ‘Kumpipa in tam bangci hi: Tam mipa thong sungah khum unlen, lungnuom taha kang kilekia masangsie an le tui na gieutausah un, ci hi,’ ci un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuale Micaiah in, “Lungnuom taha nang kilekia poma leh kei tungtawn a Topa thu gen lo hi taven,” a ci hi. Tuale ama in, “No mite aw, na unpi-un ka thugen za un!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n Remoth-gilead ah Israel kumpipa le Judah Kumpipa Jehoshaphat a kuonto uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in Jehoshaphat kungah, “Kei mituom hing kipangin gal sungah hing kuon vangin, hizongle nang in na puontuolpi hing silh in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Israel kumpipa mituom kipang a, gal sungah ama gel a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tu-in Aram kumpipa in a leeng makaite thupie-in, “Milien mineu koima tawh kido sih unlen, Israel kumpipa beh tawh kido un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Leeng makaite in Jehoshaphat a mu ciengun, “Khumpa Israel kumpipa hi ve aw,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n ama sim dingin a kihei uhi; tuale Jehoshaphat zong kikozah pai a, Topa in ama a panpi hi. Ama kung panin Pasien in amate a kaikhie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />azieh pen Israel kumpipa ahi lo lam leeng makaite in a thei bepun, ama a delna panin a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi khat in a thaltang a mawh kap leh, a galdal thep le a awmdal kikalah lutin Israel kumpipa a kha hi; tuaci’n ama in a leeng hawlpa kungah, “Kei liem zo ka hi ziehin kilekia inlen, galphuol panin ei puodawh ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ni-in gal kidona nasie mama a, nitah a si dongin Aram-te lam nga-in a leeng tungah kumpipa a kingam hi; tua ciengin nitum laitahin ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat dam le bihin Jerusalem a inn ah a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama dawn dingin Hanani’ tapa, thumu pa Jehu pusuoh a, Kumpi Jehoshaphat kungah, “Mi gilote panpi-in Topa a muda mite it ding na hi amah? Tami thu ziehin nang ang do dingin Topa kung panin ama’ lungthahna a pusuoh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hizongle na sungah hoina pawlkhat kimu hi. Azieh pen nangma in gam sung panin khuom siengthote na susie a, na lungsim sungah na Pasien sui ding na ngaisun hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem ah Jehoshaphat a teng hi; tua ciengin Beer-sheba panin Ephraim muoltung gam cieng dong mite lahah zinkia a, a pu a pate uh’ Pasien, Topa kungah amate tunpikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Judah gam sunga kul a nei khuopite zosie, a khuopi a khuopi-ah thukhente koi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuami thukhente kungah, “Mihingte tanga thukhen na hi sih vua, Topa tanga thu khen na hi zawh ziehun na nasep uh limtahin ngaisun un; ama in na thukhenna vuah note ang ompi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu-in na tung vuah Topa zatahna om taheh; na sepna vuah pilvang un, azieh pen Topa i Pasien tawh thutang leheina, mi deidanna, guhgol lahnate a omton thei sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua banah Topa adinga thukhenna pie ding le thukineite a khenpieh dingin Jehoshaphat in Jerusalem ah Levi-te pawlkhat, siempute pawlkhat, le Israel innkuon lutang pawlkhat a se hi. Amate in Jerusalem ah panmun a nei ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in tam bangin amate thu hil hi: Topa zatahna, citahna, le na lungsim zosie utawh na sem ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amau’ khuopi sunga teng na sanggamte uh tung panin sisan kisuona, thukham ahi sihle thupiehna, upadi ahi sihle biehna ngaina kipte tawh kisai-in na tung vuah thu khat popo ang tun ciengin Topa mai-ah mawna a piensah lo nading ule note tung le na sanggamte tungah lungthahna a tun lo nadingin amate thu na hil ding uhi. Tam bangin bawl un, tua hile mawna na piengsah sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />En un, Topa’ thu tawh kisai thu zosie-ah note tunga vaihawm dingin siempupi pa Amariah om hi; tuale Judah Kumpipa tawh kisai thu zosie-ah Judah innkuon uhpa Ishmael’ tapa Zebadiah om hi; tuale Levi-te in note tungah ulien sem ding uhi. Hang tahin gamta in, mi hoite tawh Topa ang omton taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam thu zaw ciengin Moab-te le Ammon-te, Meunim-te pawlkhat tawh, Jehoshaphat sim dingin a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kamtaite pei-in Jehoshaphat kungah, “Nang ang sim dingin tuipi galkhat, Edom gam panin mihon tampite ang kuon uhi; Hazazon-tamar (En-gedi a kici) ah amate kigingsa-in a om uhi,” ci-in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehoshaphat a zau hi; amama-in Topa sui ding lunggulin Judah gam muncin tengah an tan nading thu a tangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa tung panin huna sui dingin Judah in mi kaikhawm hi; Topa sui dingin Judah khuopi zosie panin amate a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn sung, leituol tha’ mai, Judah le Jerusalem-te’ kikhopna sungah Jehoshaphat ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuale, “Ka pu ka pate uh’ Pasien Topa aw, nangma, van Pasien na hi sih amah? Nam cinte’ kumpi gam zosie tungah nangma a vaihawm na hi sih amah? Nangma’ khut sungah vanglietna le thahatna om a, koima in nang ang nang zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kote’ Pasien aw, nangma in na mi Israel mai-ah tam gama teng mite na delmang a, nangma’ guolpa ahi Abraham’ suonlehlahte tungah kumtawn adingin pie hi lo na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua munah amate tengin tua sungah nangma’ min dingin biehinn khat a lam vua, amate in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Ko tungah gimna, namsau, thukhenna, ahi sihle natna, ahi sihle kielpi ang tun leh, tami biehinn sungah na min a op ziehin tami biehinn mai le na mai-ah dingin na kungah ka lungkhamna uh kang ko ding vua, tuale nangma in ei za-in nei hun ding hi,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu-in en in, Egypt gam pan a peikhiet lai-un Israel-te in na simsah lo, amate in pelin a suhsiet lo uh- Ammon, Moab le Sier Muol mite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ka luo ding vua kote nei piehsa na neisa panin ei hawlkhietna utawh amate in thaman ei pie zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kote’ Pasien aw, amate tungah thu khen lo ding na mah? Bangzieh ahei cile kote sim dinga ang kuon tam mihonpite tawh kisi dingin tha ka nei sih uhi. Ci nading mel thei loin nangma beh kang mitsuon uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua laitahin Topa mai-ah Judah zosie a zite, a tasente, le a naupangte utawh a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin a kikhawm mipi laikimah, Levi-te Asaph’ suonte sung panin Mattaniah, a tapa Jeiel, a tapa Benaiah, a tapa Zechariah, a tapa Jahaziel-te tungah Topa’ hlagau a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in, “Judah gam zosie, Jerusalem-a teng teng zosie, le Kumpi Jehoshaphat aw, ngai un. Topa in note tungah tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Zau sih unlen tam mi honpite ziehin lungkie sih un; azieh pen galdona khu nomau-a’ hi loin Pasien-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zing ciengin amate sim dingin kuonsuh un; Ziz katona lampi zui-in amate ang kuonto ding uhi; Jeruel gamlah mai-a om kuom mongah amate na mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tami gal pen note’ sim ding hi lo hi; Judah le Jerusalem mite aw, na panmun uh la-in pia malmal loin ding unlen, no tangin Topa’ guolzawna mu un,’ a ci hi. Zau sih unlen lungkie sih un; amate sim dingin zing ciengin kuon un. Topa in ang ompi ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin a mai tuol ngatin Jehoshaphat kun a, Topa mai-ah Judah zosie le Jerusalem-a teng mi zosie pua-in Topa a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Awsangpi tawh Israel Pasien, Topa a phat dingin Levi-te sung panin Kohath-te le Korah-te a dingto uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate zingmawngin a thobai vua, Tekoa senel gamah a pei uhi. Amate a pei laitahun Jehoshaphat dingin, “Judah le Jerusalem khuo-a tengte aw, ka thugen na ngai un! Topa na Pasien uh um un, tua hile na kip ding uhi; a kamsangte zong muong un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in mite tawh thu kikupna a nei zaw ciengin, Topa mai-ah la sa ding le a thupi a sienthona a phat ding mite se a, a pei kawmun amate in galkapte mai-ah, “ “ Topa tungah lungdamna ko un. Bang zieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in phatna la a sah laitahun, Judah sim dinga a pei Ammon-te, Moab-te, le Seir Muol mite buhdap dingin Topa in mi koi a, tuaci’n amate kizo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh pen Ammon-te le Moab-te in Sier Muola tengte simin a susie sieng uhi; tuale Seir-a tengte a suhsiet zaw ciengun amate khatlekhat a kisusie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Senel gam galvilna tausangah Judah-te a tun ciengun amate in mihonpi lam a en uhi; amate pen tuol lahah a puamat misi luong vive ahi uhi; amate a suohta khat beh om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate kung panin gal vanlahte khawm dingin Jehoshaphat le a mite a pei ciengun ganhingte, vante, puonsilte, le na manpha tampi tah a mu vua, tuale amate dinga a puohzawh nawn lo cieng dong uh a la uhi. Galvanlahte tam seng ahi ziehin van khawmin ni thum sung a thapaai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A ni li ni-in Beracah kuomah a kikhawm uhi, azieh pen amate in tua munah Topa a phat uhi; tua ziehin tuni dongin khum mun pen Beracah Kuom kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jehoshaphat’ makaina tawh Judah mite le Jerusalem-te zosie kipahin Jerusalem ah a kilekia uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in a galte tungah amate a lungdamsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Harp-te, lyre-te, le pengkulte tawh Jerusalem-a Topa’ biehinn ah amate a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa in Israel’ galte a simpiehna thu a zah ciengun kumpi gam zosie tungah Pasien zatahna a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuale Jehoshaphat’ uhna gam sungah gal a veng hi. Azieh pen a Pasien in ama kimvelah galvenna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaci’n Judah tungah Jehoshaphat a maang hi. A maan a kipatin ama kum sawmthum le nga pha hi; Jerusalem ah ama kum sawmni le nga sung maang hi. Ama nu’ min Azubah ahi a, Shilhi’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jehoshaphat in a pa Asa’ lampi bang zui-in ama tua panin a piel vawt sih a, Topa muna-ah thuman vive a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahi vangin munsangte kipaimang tuon lo hi; mite in a pu a pate uh’ Pasien tungah a lungsim uh a nga nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tu-in Jehoshaphat’ gamtatna a omlai teng, a patna panin a tawp dongin, Israel Kumpite’ Tangthu sunga a kiciemte, Hanani’ Tapa Jehu’ Khang Tangthu sungah kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tami zaw ciengin a gitlo gamtat Israel kumpipa Ahaziah tawh Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat kizom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate in Tarshish lama pei ding tembawte bawlna-ah ama tawh kipawlin Ezion-geber ah tembawte a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ciengin Mareshah-te Dodavahu’ tapa Eliezer in Jehoshaphat langpangin thu a gen a, “Nang in Ahaziah tawh na kipawl ziehin na bawlsa nate Topa in susie ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuale tembawte kisie a, Tarshish ah pei thei lo uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Jehoshaphat lumton a, David’ khuopi ah a pu a pate tawh ama kivui hi; a tapa Jehoram in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jehoshaphat’ tapa Jehoram’ sanggamte: Azariah, Jehiel, Zechariah, Azariah, Michael, le Shephatiah ahi uhi; tam teng zosie, Judah kumpi Jehoshaphat’ tapate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa un amate letsong, ngun, kham, le a manpha neisate tampitah pie a, Judah gama kulnei khuopite tawh a piehtha hi; hizongle ama pen a ta masa pen ahi ziehin ama in Jehoram tungah kumpi gam a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pa’ kumpi topha tungah Jehoram ka-in a dinkip ciengin a sanggam pasal zosie namsau tawh thatin Israel uliente kimkhat zong that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama a maan patin Jehoram kum sawmthum le ni pha hi; Jerusalem ah ama kum giet sung a maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahab’ tanu pen ama’ zi ahi ziehin ama in Ahab innkuon ma bangin Israel kumpite’ lampi a zui hi. Topa muna-ah ama a sie lamin a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hizongle Topa in David le a sunlehlahte tungah meivah khat pieh zing dingin kamciem a, David tawh thuciemna bawl zo ahi ziehin ama in David innkuon a susie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama’ hun sungin Edom in Judah’ uhna ledo a, amau’ kumpi tuom a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin a galkapmangte le a leeng zosie tawh Jehoram galkai a, zanlai-in kuonin ama in ama le a leeng lamkaite a kuikhum Edom-te a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n tuni dongin Edom-te in Judah’ uhna a ledo uhi. Ama in a pu a pate’ Pasien, Topa a taisan ziehin khum hun laitahin Libnah in zong ama’ uhna a ledo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua tham loin, ama in Judah muoltung gamah munsangte bawl a, citah lona lamah Jerusalem-a tengte pui-in, Judah lam a pielsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kamsang Elijah kung panin ama tungah laihlah khat tung a, “Na pu David’ Pasien, Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Azieh pen na pa Jehoshaphat’ lampi le Judah kumpi Asa’ lampi na tawn sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />nang in Israel kumpite’ lampi na zuizaw a, Ahab innkuon in citah lona lamah Israel a pui bangin Judah le Jerusalem-a tengte citah lona lamah na pui a, na pa’ inn sung panin nangma sanga a hoizaw na sanggamte zong na tha sieng zo ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />en in, Topa in na mite, na tate, na zite, le na neisa zosie tungah gimna lienpi khat ang tungsah ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />nangmama in tam natna ziehin a ni ni-in na gilzam a lawt dongin gil natna nasie khat na vei ding hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ethiopia-te’ gei-a om Philistia-te le Arab-te, Jehoram tunga a thangpai thei nadingun Topa in a kuontaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah sim dingin amate kuonto-in a bulu vua, kumpipa’ inn-a om neisa zosie, a tapate le a zite tawh tommang siengin, a tapa tumpen Jehoahaz ci simlo a tapate a kinuasie om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tami thu zosie zaw ciengin Topa in a dam thei lo natna khat tawh a gil a nasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hun a cin, kum ni tawp ciengin a natna ziehin a gil lawt a, nahpi-in na sa-in a si hi. A pu a pate adinga tumphuol a tawpieh bangun a mite in ama zatahna-in tumphuol a tawpieh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A uh ding a kipatin kum sawmthum le kum ni a pha hi; ama in Jerusalem-ah kum giet sung uh a, koima’ hlenla vawt loin a si hi. David’ khuopi sungah ama a vui vua, hizongle kumpite’ han sungah kivui lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem-a tengte in ama’ za luo dingin a tapa tumpen Ahaziah kumpi-in a koi uhi; azieh pen Arab-te tawh giephuola a pei galkapte in tapa tazaw zosiete a that sieng uhi. Tuaci’n Judah kumpi Jehoram’ tapa Ahaziah kumpi-in a maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaziah a maan ding a kipatin kum sawmli le ni pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah kum khat sung maang hi. Ama nu’ min Athaliah ahi a, Omri’ tunu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sie lam bawlna-ah a nu khu ama’ thu kuppi ahi ziehin ama in zong Ahab’ innkuon’ lampi a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahab innkuonpite ma bangin Topa muna-ah ama a sie-in gamta hi; bangzieh ahei cile a pa a si zaw ciengin ama’ siet nadinga a thu kikuppite pen Ahab’ innkuonte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in amau’ thuhil nangawn zui a, Aram kumpipa Hazael tawh kido dingin Ramoth-gilead ah Israel kumpipa Ahab’ tapa Jehoram tawh a kuonton hi. Aram-te in Joram a liemsah vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuale Ramah ah Aram kumpipa Hazael tawh a kidona pana a nga liemmate a dam nadingin Jezreel ah kilekia hi. Jezreel ah Ahab’ tapa Joram a cinat ziehin a ve dingin Judah kumpi Jehoram’ tapa Ahaziah a kuonsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hizongle Joram ve dingin ama a hawna ziehin Ahaziah’ zakieh nading pen Pasien’ laitansa ahi hi. Azieh pen ama khum munah a tun ciengin Ahab’ innkuon susie dinga Topa in sathau a nusa Nimshi’ tapa Jehu tawh kimu dingin Jehoram a pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehu in Ahab’ innkuonte tungah thukhenna a sep laitahin Judah uliente le Ahaziah’ na a sem Ahaziah’ sanggam pasalte’ tapate tawh a kituoh a, ama in amate a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in Ahaziah sui a, Samaria ah a kibuh laitahin ama kiman a, Jehu kungah kizawpi-in kithat hi. Amate in ama a vui uhi, azieh pen amate in, “Ama pen a lungsim zosie tawh Topa a sui Jehoshaphat’ tupa ahi hi,” a ci uhi. Tuale ciengin Ahaziah’ suonlehlahte in kumpi gam a uh zo ding mi khat zong a nei nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahaziah’ nu Athaliah in tu-in a tapa a si lam a thei ciengin ama kipanin Judah inn sunga kumpi innkuon zosie that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin kumpipa’ tanu Jehoshabeath in Ahaziah’ tapa Joash la a, tha dinga kikoi kumpipa’ tapate lah panin ama a gudap hi; ama nu in lupna tung khatah ama le a cingnu a koi hi. Ama pen Ahaziah’ sanggamnu ahi ziehin Kumpi Jehoram’ tanu, le siempu Jehoiada’ zi Jehoshabeath in tua bangin Athalia’ kung panin ama na phuol a, tua nu in ama that kha lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Athaliah gam sungah a maan laitahin Pasien’ biehinn sungah ama kum guh sung kiphuol hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahi vangin a kum sagina kumin Jehoiada kihansuo-in galkap a za-a a uhte, Jeroham’ tapa Azariah, Jehonanan’ tapa Ishmael, Obed’ tapa Azariah, Adaiah’ tapa Maaseiah, Zichri’ tapa Elishaphat tawh kithukimna khat a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah gam muncin tengah amate zin kawikawi-in Judah khuopi zosie panin Levi-te, le Israel innkuonte’ lutang teng khawmin Jerusalem-ah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin a kikhawm buppi in Pasien’ biehinnpi sungah kumpipa’ tapa Joash tawh thuciemna khat a bawl uhi. Jehoiada in amate kungah, “Kumpipa’ tapa! David’ suonte tawh kisai-in Topa’ ciemsa bangin ama kumpi-in maangsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami khu note’ sep ding ahi hi: Sabbath ni-a nasep a lut ding no siempute le Levi-te sung pan sethum-suoh-sekhat tunkotcing na hi ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a sekhat kumpipa’ inn-ah omin, a sekhat Tunkot Phungpi-ah na om ding uhi; tuale Topa’ biehinn leituolah mi zosie a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siempute le tuonvai sem ahi Levi-te ci longal koima Topa’ biehinn sungah lutsah sih un; a siengtho ahi ziehun amate lut thei ding a, hinanle adang mi zosiete in Topa’ thuhilna na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Levi-te in a khut sung vuah a galhiem ciet uh tawi-in kumpipa kimvelah a om ding uhi; tuale biehinn sunga a lut poma kithat ding hi. A sungtumna le a pusuona-ah kumpipa tawh om un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levi-te le Judah zosie in siempu Jehoiada’ thupieh teng zosie bangin a gamta uhi; siempu Jehoiada in a kisekhente phiet lo ahi ziehin amau’ mi ciet sabbath ni-a nasem lote tawh sabbath ni-a nasemte peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siempu Jehoiada in galkap bute tungah Topa’ biehinn sunga kikoi David-a’ ahi ngai teipite le lum gol le lum neute a pie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuale ama in mi zosie a galhiem ciet utawh kumpipa cing dingin biehinn leitaw lam panin leilu lam pang dong, maitam kimkot le biehinn kimkotah pangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in kumpipa’ tapa peipi-in a lu tungah kumpi lukhu khusah a, ama tungah thuciemna a pie hi; amate in ama kumpi a hina thu taang a tawh vua, Jehoiada le a tapate in ama sathau nu-in, “Kumpipa dam sawt heh!” ci-in a awng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mite tai-in kumpipa a a lungdampina uh gamlumna Athaliah in a zah ciengin, Topa’ biehinn sunga mite kungah a lut hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuale ama nu in a en leh biehinn lutna khuompi gei-ah kumpipa ding a, kumpipa gei-ah galkap bute le pengkul tumte omin, gam sunga mi zosie kipahin pengkulte a mut uhi, tuale tuami pawi bawlna-ah lasate in a tumtheite utawh a makai uhi. Athaliah in a puon ehmalin, “Kumpi suon sawm! Kumpi suon sawm!” ci-in a awng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu Jehoiada in galkapte uh dinga kikoi galkap bute hlanin amate kungah, “Galkap guolte kikalah tua nu peipi un; ama a zui poma namsau tawh kithat ding hi,” a ci hi. Bangzieh ahei cile siempu pa in, “ Topa’ biehinn sungah tua nu that sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in ama a man uhi; kumpipa’ inn Sakol Tunkot vangah ama lutin khum munah ama a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa’ mi ahi nading uh Jehoiada in ama le mi zosie le kumpipa kikalah thuciemna khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Baal’ inn sungah mi zosie lutin a inn a phelpieh uhi; ama’ maitamte le a milimte satcimin tua maitamte mai-ah Baal siempu Mattan a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Moses thukham sunga kigiel bangin David’ thupieh dung zui-in lungdamna le lasahna tawh Topa tungah meihal biehnate a kipieh nadingin David in a na sesa bangin Topa’ biehinn en dingin Jehoiada in Levi siempute tungah mawpuohna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lam khat popo tawh a bua mi khat a lut lo nadingin ama in Topa’ biehinn tunkotte-ah tunkot cingte a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in galkap bute, uliente, mipite a uhte le gam sung mi zosie a zawpi a, tuale amate in Topa’ biehinn panin tunkot tungnung zui-in kumpipa a peipisuh uhi. Amate in kumpi topha tungah kumpipa a tosah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n namsau tawh Athaliah a kitha zaw ciengin gam sung mi zosie a kipah vua, khuopi sung a dai pai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joash a maan ding a kipatin kum sagi pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah kum sawmli sung maang hi. Ama nu’ min pen Zibiah ahi a, Beer-sheba-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siempu Jehoiada’ hun sung teng zosie Topa muna-ah Joash a manin gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehoiada in ama ading zi ni suipieh a, tanu tapate’ pa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hun phabep khat zaw ciengin Joash in Topa’ biehinn puophat dingin a khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in siempute le Levi-te khawmin amate kungah, “Pasien’ biehinn puophat nadingin Judah khuopite-ah pei unlen, a kum kumin Israel zosie tung panin sum va khon ta un; tam thu na naw sep ding uh ahi ci thei un,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin Levi-te in a naw sep tuon sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in uhpipa Jehoiada hlanin ama kungah, “Bang dingin Topa’ nasem Moses in thuciemna puonbuh adingin a kikhawm Israel mihonte tung pana sieh kikhon pen Judah le Jerusalem-te tung pan Levi-te khonsah lo na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tua numei gilo Athaliah’ tapate in Pasien’ biehinn susie-in Topa’ biehinn sunga a ki-apsa na zosie nangawn Baal-te adingin a zang zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in thupie a, amate in singkuong khat bawlin Topa’ biehinn tunkot pulamah a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Senel gam sungah Pasien’ nasem Moses a op lai-un Israel tungah a ngetsa sieh Topa adinga a puoh nadingun Judah le Jerusalem sung zosie-ah tangtawhna khat kibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Makai zosie le mi zosie lungdamin a sieh uh peipi-in singkuong sungah a dim masangsie a khie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levi-te in kumpipa’ uliente kungah tua singkuong a peipi sielun amate in tua sungah sum tampi a op lam a mu ciengun, kumpipa’ thuvanpi pa le siempupi pa’ ulien pa pei-in singkuong bungdawhin sumte a la vua, a opna ngai-ah tua singkuong a koikia uhi. Tuaci’n a ni ni-in amate in a bawl vua, sum tampitah a khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa le Jehoiada in Topa’ biehinn nasep uhte kungah tua sumte a pie vua, tua Topa’ biehinn a ngaingai a bangsahkia dingin amate in leilesuong nasep a siemte le khutsiemte, le Topa’ biehinn a puokia dingin sia le sumngo nasep a siemte zong a ciel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n nasem dinga a kicielte in na nahpi-in a sem vua, amau’ khut sungah puokiana nasep in mai nawt a, amate in a ngaingai bangin Topa’ biehinn a bawlkia vua, a kipsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in a zaw ciengun kumpipa le Jehoiada kungah a sumval teng uh tawi-in tua teng tawh Topa’ biehinn nasep nading le meihal biehnate dinga vanzahte, tawkeute, khamte, le ngun beelte a bawl uhi. Jehoiada’ hin sung tungtawnin Topa’ biehinn sungah meihal biehnate a kizomin a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hizongle Jehoiada vuoi mama ta a, a kum a cin ciengin ama a si hi; a si-in ama kum za le kum sawmthum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in Israel sungah Pasien le a biehinn adingin na hoi sem ahi ziehin amate in David’ khuopi sunga kumpite lahah ama a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu-in Jehoiada a si zaw ciengin kumpipa kungah Judah uliente pei-in zatahna a pie uhi; tua ciengin kumpipa in amau’ thu a ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in a pu a pate uh’ Pasien, Topa’ biehinn a taisan vua, khuom siengthote le milimte’ na a sem uhi. Amau’ khielna ziehin Judah le Jerusalem tungah lungthahna a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa kungah amate a peipikia thei nadingin ama in amate lahah kamsangte a sawl hi; tamte in a langkhat vuah teci pang a, ahi vangin amate in a ngai tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien’ hlagau in siempu Jehoiada’ tapa Zechariah man hi; mite tung lamah ama dingin amate kungah, “Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Na mavan thei lo nadingun bang dingin Topa’ thupiehnate palsat na hi uh ahei? Note in Topa na taisan ziehun ama in note ang taisan hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in ama sawmdapin kumpipa thupiehna tawh Topa’ biehinn leituol zangah suong tawh a seplia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kumpipa Joash in ama tungah Zechariah’ pa Jehoiada in a na lah migitna phawh kha nawn loin a tapa a thapieh mawh hi. Ama in a si kuonin, “ Topa in mu hinlen phu la taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum tawp lam ciengin Joash sim dingin Aram galkapte a kuonto uhi. Judah le Jerusalem ah amate a tung vua, tua teng lah panin mite’ uliente zosie a that vua, a vanlahte zosie uh Damascus kumpipa kungah a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aram galkapte mi tawmno a kuon vangun, amate in a pu a pate uh’ Pasien, Topa a nuasie ziehun Topa in a khut sung vuah galkap tampi a pie hi. Amate in Joash tungah tua bangin thukhenna a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nahpi taha a liemsa-in ama nuasie-in, amate a nuakin zaw ciengun, siempu Jehoiada tapa’ sisan ziehin a nasemte in ama tha dingin a sawmdap vua, amate in a lupna tungah ama a that uhi. Tuaci’n ama si a, amate in David’ khuopi sungah ama a vui vua, hinanle amate in kumpite hanah ama a vui sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama a sawmdap pen Ammon-te Shimeath’ tapa Zabad, le Moab-te Shimrith’ tapa Jehozabad ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama’ tapate’ thute, ama a kigensietna thute, le Pasian’ biehinn a kilamkiana thute, Kumpite’ Khang Tangthu Laibu sungah kigiel hi. Tuale a tapa Amaziah in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amaziah maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni le nga pha hi; ama in Jerusalem ah kum sawmni le kuo sung maang hi. Ama nu’ min pen Jerusalem-te Jehoaddan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa muna-ah a manin gamta a, ahi vangin a lungsim mantah tawh hi nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A khut sungah kumpi thuneina a op zaw behin ama in a pa kumpipa a that ama’ nasemte that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa’ thupieh Moses’ laibu sungah, “Tate ziehin pate kithat lo ding a, pate ziehin zong tate kithat lo ding hi; ahi vangin mi zosie amau’ mawna hang tawh a si ding uhi,” ci-in a na kigiel ma bangin ama in a tate a that sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaziah in Judah mite khawm a, ama in amau’ pupa innkuon tawh kizui-in Judah mi zosie le Benjamin mi zosiete, a tul a uhte le a za a uhte’ khut nei-ah koi hi. Ama in kum sawmni le a tungsie mite khawm a, gal sim thei, tei le lum a zang thei, le a kituomteel galkap tul zathum a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Israel sung panin ngun talent zakhat tawh a thahat galhang mi tul zakhat zong a ciel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama kungah Pasien’ mi khat pei-in, “Kumpipa aw, nangma tawh Israel galkap peitonsah sin. Azieh pen Topa in Israel- tam Ephraim mi zosie- ompi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangma mama kuonzaw inlen sem in. Galdona-ah thahat in, tua hi sihle Pasien in galte mai-ah ang thalpai ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in huna ding ahi a, thalpaina ding ahi zongin vanglietna a nei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaziah in Pasien’ mipa kungah, “Hizongle Israel galkapte guoi nadinga ka piehsa talent zakhat bang ka law ta diei?” a ci hi. Pasien’ mipa in dawng a, “ Topa in tam sangin a tamzaw zong ang piehbe thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Amaziah in Ephraim panin ama kunga a pei galkapte, inna peikia dingin a sawl hi. Ahi vangin amate Judah tungah a lungthah mama vua, lungsosa-in inn lam a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaziah kihangsahin a mite peipi hi; ama Ci Kuom lamah pei-in Seir mite tulsawm that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah mite in adang mi tulsawm hingmatin Sela muolvumah a peipi vua, tuale a unpi-a guoicim dingin Sela muolvum panin amate a sepsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanle ama tawh gal kuon ding a phal lo, a sawlkia galkapte in Samaria panin Beth-horon dongah Judah khuopite a na sim uhi; amate in tuate sungah mi tulthum a that vua, van tampitah a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Edom-te a thana panin Amaziah a pei zaw ciengin Seir-te’ pasien-te peipi-in ama’ pasien dingin tuate koi a, tuate bie-in tuate tungah biehnate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaziah tungah Topa lungthahin ama kungah kamsang khat sawl a, tua pa in, “Bang dingin na khut panin ama’ mite a hunkhie zo lo, mite’ pasien-te po bel talawm na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in thu a gen laitahin kumpipa in ama kungah, “Kumpipa’ thu kuppi pa dingin nang kang koi uh amah? Khawl in! Bang dinga nang hing kithat ding ahei?” a ci hi. Tuaci’n kamsangpa zong khawl a, hinanle ama in, “Nangma tam bang gamta-in kang thu kuppina na ngai lo ziehin Pasien in nangma ang suhsiet ding a lungsim sungah a khensatna ka thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah kumpi Amaziah in mi tawh a kikup zaw ciengin Israel kumpi, Jehu’ tapa Jehoahaz, a tapa Joash kungah mi sawlin, “Hing pei in; khatlekhat kisi vai,” cisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Joash in Judah kumpi Amaziah kungah thu puohin, “Lebanon-a thangling kung khat in Lebanon-a taamtah kung khat kungah thu zasah a, ‘Ka tapa’ zi dingin na tanu ei pie in,’ a ci hi; ahi vangin gamsa khat suohin tua thangling a tuoncil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangma in, ‘En in, Edom-te ka zo zo hi,’ na ci a, na lungsim kiliensah gawp hi. Tu-in inn ah om khinkhian in; nangma le Judah na puaton nadingin bang dinga buoina na piensah ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin Amaziah in a thu mang lo hi; azieh pen amate in Edom pasien-te a bieh ziehun, Pasien in a galte uh’ khut sungah amate a pieh thei nadinga tua khu Pasien’ nasepna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel kumpipa Joash kuonto hi; ama le Judah kumpipa Amaziah, Judah gam Beth-shemesh ah khatlekhat gal sungah a kisi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel in Judah a zo hi; mi zosie a inn ciet vuah a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jehoash in Beth-shemesh ah Ahaziah’ tapa Joash, a tapa Judah kumpipa Amaziah manin Jerusalem ah peipi a, Ephraim Tunkot panin Tunkot Ninglam cieng dong tong zali sung Jerusalem kulpi a satguoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in kumpipa’ inn sunga om kham le ngun zosie, le Topa’ biehinn sunga kimu vanzah zosie tawh Obed-edom manton hi; ama in kumpipa’ inn sunga gou kikhol teng tomgamin a mite zong manin Samaria ah a peikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel kumpi, Jehoahaz’ tapa Joash a si zaw Judah kumpi Joash’ tapa Amaziah kum sawm le nga sung hing lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu-in Amaziah’ nasep a omlaite, a patna panin a tawpna dong, Judah le Israel Kumpite’ Khang Tangthu Laibu sungah kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa kung pana Amaziah a kiheimang a kipanin amate in Jerusalem ah ama sawmdapna khat a nei ciengun Lachish ah ama a tai hi. Ahi vangin amate in Lachish ah ama a nuadelsah vua, tua munah ama a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in sakol tawh ama’ luong a puo uhi; David’ khuopi sungah a pu a pate tawh ama kivui hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah mi zosie in kum sawm le guh a pha Uzziah a la vua, a pa Amaziah’ za luo dingin ama kumpi-in a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa si-in a pu a pate tawh a lupton zaw ciengin ama in Eloth lamkia-in Judah adingin a ngakia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpi sep a kipatin Uzziah kum sawm le guh pha a, ama in Jerusalem-ah kum sawmnga le ni sung uh hi. Ama nu’ min Jecoliah hi a, Jerusalem-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pa Amaziah’ gamtat bang lienin Topa muna-ah ama a manin a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in ama tunga Pasien zatah ding a hil Zechariah hun sungin Pasien sui hi; tuale Topa a sui laisie Pasien in ama lawcingsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama kuonin Philistia-te sim a, Gath kulpi, Jabneh kulpi, Ashdod kulpite satguoi hi; ama in Ashdod gam sung le Philistia-te’ gam sung mundang tengah khuopite a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Philistia-te, Gur-baal a teng Arab-te, le Meunim-te a simna-ah Pasien in ama panpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ammon-te in Uzziah tungah sieh le kaih a puoh vua, ama a thahat mama khat a suo ziehin ama’ minthanna in Egypt gamgi cieng dong nangawn zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tham loin Uzziah in Jerusalem-a Kulning Tunkot, Kuom Tunkot, le Kiukawi-ah tausangte daw a, tuate kul tawh a im hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in gamlahah tausangte daw a, Shephelah le zanglei-ah ganhon a hau ziehin tuikhuh tampi to a, lei nasep a uh ziehin muoltung le leihoina gamte-ah lohlote le lenggui leibawlte a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua tham loin kumpipa’ galkapmangte khat ahi Hananiah’ uhna nei-a om thuvanpi pa Jeiel le galkap bupa Maaseiah in min khumna laibu sunga mi phaza a sim uh dung zui-in, Uzziah in a pawl pawlin galsim thei galkap tampi tah nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A pu a pate uh’ innkuon lutang mi thahat galhangte a phaza a unpi-in tulni le zaguh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A uhna nei vuah kumpipa panpi ding le thahatna tawh gal do thei ding galkap tul zathum le tul sagi le zanga om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Uzziah in galkapte zosie dingin lumte, teipite, sia lukhute, sia-songkholte, thalte, se ding suongtangte guon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in Jerusalem-a tausangte tung le innkiute tungah thal kap nading le suong golte se nadingin khutsiem nasemte’ bawl sette a koi hi. A thahat dongin lamdang tahin ama a kipanpi ziehin gamlapi-ah a minthanna kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama a thahat zaw ciengin a manthai na gau dingin a kiphatsahna a khang hi. Bang ding ahei cile Topa a Pasien tungah ama tawnkhiel a, namtui maitam tungah biehna pie dingin Topa’ biehinn sungah ama a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanle siempu Azariah, a thahat Topa’ siempu sawmgiet tawh ama’ nua a zui uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />amate in kumpipa Uzziah a deh bawl vua, tuale ama kungah, “Uzziah aw, Topa tunga biehna pieh ding pen nang pieh ding hi lo hi. Biehna pie dinga ki-apsa Aaron’ suon siempute pieh ding ahi bo hi. Mun siengtho sung panin pusuoh in; azieh pen na gamta khiel zo a, tua in Topa Pasien tung pan nang tungah patawina ang tun sih ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Uzziah a lung a thah hi. Tu-in ama in a khutah gimnamtui beel khat tawi a, siempute tungah a lungthah laitahin gimnamtui maitam gei Topa’ biehinn sungah siempute’ musietin a talpangah phahnatna khat puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siempupi pa Azariah le siempu zosie in ama a et ciengun a talpangah phahnatna a vei hi. A mallang tahin a pulamah ama a peisah vua, Topa in ama gawt zo ahi ziehin ama a pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A si dongin Kumpi Uzziah phah a, ama miphah ahi ziehin inn tuom khatah a teng hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ biehinn panin ama kipuse hi. Ama’ tapa Jotham in kumpi’ inn sung vai puo-in, tua gam mite tungah zong vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu-in Uzziah’ gamtatna a omlai teng, a patna panin a tawpna dong, Amoz’ tapa kamsang Isaiah in giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Uzziah lumton hi; amate in a pu a pate kunga kumpite’ neisa lopang lah hanah ama a vui uhi, azieh pen, “Ama a phah ahi hi,” a ci uhi. Ama’ tapa Jotham in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jotham a maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni le nga pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah kum sawm le guh sung maang hi. Ama nu’ min Jerushah ahi a, Zadok’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A pa Uzziah’ sepsa bang lienin Topa muna-ah a manin ama gamta a- Topa’ biehinnpi sung behah ama lut lo hi. Hinanle mite in a sie gamtatnate zom lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Topa’ tunkot tungnung lam a, Ophel kul tungah zong inn tampi a lambe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tham loin ama in Judah muoltung gamah khuopite, le sing tamna muoltang tengah kulte ciengin tausangte a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ammon-te’ kumpipa tawh kido-in amate a zo hi. Khum kumin Ammon-te in ngun talent zakhat, mangbu cor tulsawm le mangbuham cor tulsawm ama a pie uhi. Ammon-te in a kum nina le a kum thumna kumin tua za ma a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jotham in Topa a Pasien mai-ah a gamtatna bawlpha ahi ziehin ama a thahat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu-in Jotham’ gamtatna a omlai teng, le a galsimna zosiete, le a om dante, Israel le Judah Kumpite’ Tangthu Laibu sungah kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama a maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni le nga pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah kum sawm le guh sung a maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh lumton a, David’ khuopi sungah ama a vui uhi; tuale a tapa Ahaz in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaz maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah kum sawm le guh sung maang hi. A pu David’ sepsa bangin Topa muna-ah a manin gamta loin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel kumpite’ lampite zuizaw hi. Ama in Baal adingin a kisung milimte nangawn bawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuale Hinnom tapa’ kuomah biehnate pie-in Topa in Israel mite mai-a a nawmangsa minamte’ zah a kidahhuoi gamtatnate zui-in mei tawh a tapate a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama kithoi-in munsangte tung, muoltangte tung le singlim nei zosie-ah biehnate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a Topa Pasien in Aram kumpipa’ khut sungah ama pie a, Damascus ah a mite tampitah salin a peipi hi. Mi tampi thatin ama a zo Israel kumpipa’ khut sungah zong ama kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in a pu a pate uh’ Pasien, Topa a nuasie ziehun Remailiah’ tapa Pekah in nikhat thu-in Judah sungah mi tul zakhat le tul sawmni that a, amate pen a unpi-in mi thahat galhangte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ephraim-te a thahat galhang Zichri in kumpipa’ tapa Maaseiah, kumpi innpi a uh Azrikam, le kumpi zomah thunei pen ahi Elkanah-te that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mite in amau’ tanaute sung panin numeite, tapate, le tanute, mi tul zani a man vua, amate kung panin van tampitah zong a la uhi; amate in Samaria ah tua vante a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua munah Topa’ kamsang khat om a. ama’ min pen Oded ahi hi; Samaria ah ang tung galkapte dawn dingin ama pusuohin amate kungah, “Judah tungah na pu na pate uh’ Pasien, Topa lungthah ahi ziehin ama in na khut sung vuah amate ang pie a, ahi vangin thangpaina tawh amate na that vua, tua khu vantung dong a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu-in note in Judah mite le Jerusalem mite, pasal le numeite nuoinetin salin na bawl sawm uhi. Ahi vangin Topa na Pasien uh tungah mawna nei hi lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in ka thugen ngai unlen, na tanaute uh sung panin gala na mat zosie uh puohkia un, azieh pen na tung vuah Topa’ lungthahna lienpi a tung hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua tham loin, Ephraim-te’ uhpite pawlkhat, Johanan’ tapa Azariah, Meshellemoth’ tapa Berechiah, Shallum’ tapa Jehizkiah, le Hadlai’ tapa Amasa-te, galsimna pana ang tung mite langkhatah a pang vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />amate kungah, “Tulaitaha ka mawnate ule ka khielnate ban vuah Topa langpanna zieha mawnate ka tung vuah ei tut sawm na hi ziehun, tam munah galmatte nang tut sih ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile ka khielna uh a lien seng ta a, Israel tungah Topa’ lungthahna lienpi a om hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n galhangte in galmatte le a lah uh vante miliente le a kikhawm mi zosie’ mai-ah a nuasie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin a min tawh kihlante dingto-in galmatte a peipi vua, tuale amate lahah a guohtanga omte zosie puon a silsah uhi; amate puon a silsah vua, kedapte pie-in an le tui zong va-in sathau a nu uhi; tuale a thazawngkhal teng laa tungah tuongsahin lutu kung khuopi ahi Jericho-a a tanaute uh kungah a zawpi uhi. Tua ciengin Samaria ah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin Kumpi Ahaz in Assyria kumpipa kungah huna ngen dingin mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen Edom-te in gal bawlkia-in Judah simin a zo vua, a mite galmatin a kaimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Philistia-te in Shephelah le Judah-te’ Negeb gama khuopite a bulu vua, Beth-shemesh, Aijalon, Gederoth, Soco-a khuoneute tawh, Timnah-a khuoneute tawh, le Gimzo-a khuoneute tawh a la uhi; tua munah amate a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Ahaz in Judah sungah kidehna om loin phengtat a, Topa tungah a na citah lo ziehin Topa in Judah a niemkhieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama kungah Assyria Kumpipa Tiglath-pileser a pei vangin, koi’ thakhausah tah zawh sangin ama a gawtbawl zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Ahaz in Topa’ biehinn, kumpipa’ inn, le uliente’ inn sunga van kikoi zosie la-in Assyria kumpipa kungah sieh le kaihte a puoh hi; hinanle tua in ama a hu zo tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A genthei hun ciengin Topa tungah tami Kumpi Ahaz pen ma citah lo zeh lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh pen ama a zo Damascus’ pasien-te kungah ama kithoi a, “Aram kumpite’ pasien-te in amate a panpi ziehin amate in kei zong ei panpi thei nadingun amate tungah kithoina ka bawl ding hi,” ci hi. Hizongle tuate pen ama le Israel zosie’ kisietna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahaz in Pasien’ biehinn sunga vanzahte khawmin satguoi a, ama in Topa’ biehinn kotte khahcipin Jerusalem ningkiu cintengah maitam a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in pasien dangte tungah biehna a pieh thei nadingin Judah khuopi zosie-ah munsangte bawlin, a pu le pate’ Pasien, Topa a lungthahsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu-in ama gamtatna a omlaite le a omzie vannuoi, a patna panin a tawpna dong, Judah le Israel Kumpite’ Tangthu Laibu sungah kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Ahaz lumton a, tuale amate in Jerusalem khuopi sungah ama a vui uhi; hinanle amate in Israel kumpite’ hanah ama a puo sih uhi. A tapa Hezekiah in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekiah a maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni le nga pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah kum sawmni le kuo sung maang hi. Ama nu’ min Abijah ahi a, Zechariah’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A pu David’ na bawlsa bang lienin Topa muna-ah a manin a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama a maan a kum khatna, a hla masa sungin ama in Topa’ biehinn kotte hongin tua teng a puopha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in siempute le Levi-te peipi a, nisuona lam mun awngah amate a khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Levi-te aw, ka thugen ei ngai un! No le no kisiensuo unlen, na pu na pate uh’ Pasien, Topa’ biehinn siengthosahin mun siengtho panin a niehte nawnkhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen i pu i pate na citah loin Topa i Pasien’ muna-ah na siet gamtat uhi; amate in ama na taisanin Topa’ tenna panin a mai uh hei-in na nuangat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in talaap kotte zong khahin meivahte a sumit vua, Israel Pasien kung a siengtho munah gimnamtui hal loin meihal biehna a pie sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Judah le Jerusalem tungah Topa’ lungthahna tung a, na mit vua na mu bangun ama in cimulthaw huoi, cizathuoi, le ehnehhuoi-in amate a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami thu ziehin i pu i pate namsau-in a si zo ta vua, i tapate, i tanute, le i zite salin a om zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu-in eite kung panin a giinhuoi a lungthahnate a kiheimang thei nadingin ka lungsim sungah Topa tawh thuciem khat bawl ding a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka tate aw, Topa in ama’ na semin ama opna-ah a ding ding, le ama kungah biehnate a pie dingin note ang teel zo tah ziehin tu-in tami thu nelsie bawl sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Levi-te, Kohath’ suonte sung panin Amasiah’ tapa Mahath, le Azariah’ tapa Joel; Merari’ suonte sung panin Abdi’ tapa Kish, le Jehallelel’ tapa Azariah; Gershon’ suonte sung panin Zimmah’ tapa Joah, le Joah’ tapa Eden;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />le Elizaphan’ suonte sung panin Shimri le Jeuel; Asaph’ suonte sung panin Zechariah le Mattaniah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Heman’ suonte sung panin Jehiel le Shimei; Jeduthun’ suonte sung panin Shemaiah le Uzziel-te a kipan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in a sanggamte uh khawmin a kisiensuotawm vua, Topa’ kammal tawh kumpipa thupieh bangin Topa’ biehinn puosieng dingin a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A puosieng dingin Topa’ biehinn sungtawngah siempute a lut vua, Topa’ biehinnpi sunga a mu uh a nieh teng zosie Topa’ biehinn tuolah peipi uhi; tuale Levi-te in tuate la-in Kidron Lui-ah a buo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in a hla masa a ni masa ni-in siensuo ding kipanin tua hla a ni giet ni-in Topa’ talaap-ah a pei uhi; tua ciengin amate in ni giet sung Topa’ biehinn a siensuo vua, a hla masa a ni sawm le guh ni-in a zo sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Hezekiah kungah tumin, “ Topa’ biehinn zosie, mei halna maitam le vanzah zosie, le anlum guolte koina sabuoi le vanzah zosie ka puosieng zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpi Ahaz in kumpi a sep lai-in a citah lona ziehin ama in a na paimang vanzah zosie siensuo-in a baisa-in ka bawl zo uhi; en in, Topa’ mai-ah tuate a om hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Hezekiah thobai a, khuopi-a uliente khawmin, Topa’ biehinn ah a peito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in kumpi gam, mun siengtho mun le Judah gam adingin mawna zieha biehna dingin bawngtang sagi, tuutang sagi, tuuno sagi, le keel sagi a kai uhi. Ama in Topa’ maitam tungah tuate a pie dingin Aaron’ suon siempute thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n bawngtangte a go vua, siempute in a si la-in maitam tungah a the uhi; amate in tuutangte a go vua, a si tawh maitam a the uhi; amate in tuunote zong go-in a si tawh maitam a the uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin mawna zieha biehna dingin kumpipa le a kikhawmte kungah keeltang sagi kikai hi; amate in tuate tungah a khut a ngam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuale Israel zosie ading thoidamna bawl nadingin, siempute in tuate a go vua, tuate’ sisan tawh maitam tungah mawna zieha biehna a pie uhi. Bang ding ahei cile Israel zosie adingin meihal biehna le mawna zieha biehna a bawl ding uh kumpipa in thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />David le kumpipa’ thumu pa Gad le kamsang Nathan’ thupiehna tawh kizui-in Topa’ biehinn sungah ama in daltuote, harp-te, le lyre-te tum dingin Levi-te koi hi. Bangzieh ahei cile tuami thupiehna pen a kamsangte tungtawnin Topa tung pana ang pei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David’ tumgingte tawh Levi-te a ding vua, tuale pengkulte tawh siempute a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hezekiah in maitam tungah meihal biehna a kipieh nadingin thu a pie hi. Meihal biehna a kipat ciengin Topa tungah lasahna zong kipan pai a, Israel kumpi David’ lasahnate in pengkulte a zawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A kikhawm mi buppi in Pasien a bie vua, lasate in la sa-in, pengkul tumte in a tum uhi; meihal biehna a man masangsie tam teng zosie a kizomin a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Biehnate a man zaw ciengin kumpipa le ama kunga a om zosie kunin Pasien a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />David’ thugente le thumu pa Asaph’ thugente tawh Topa tungah phatna la a sah nadingun Hezekiah kumpipa le uliente in Levi-te thu a pie uhi. Lungdamna tawh amate in phatna late a sa vua, amate kunin Pasien a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hezekiah in, “Tu-in Topa tungah noma ma na kisiensuo zo uhi; keima ei nai unlen Topa’ biehinn-ah biehpiehnate le lungdamkona biehnate hing peipi un,” a ci hi. A kikhawmte in zong biehpiehnate le lungdamko biehnate a peipi uhi; tuale piehnopna lungsim a nei zosie in meihal biehnate a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A kikhawmte in a peipi meihal biehna phaza pen bawngtang sawm sagi, tuutang zakhat, le tuuno zani ahi a, tamte zosie pen Topa tunga meihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A kisiensuo biehnate bawngtang zaguh le tuu tulthum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanle siempute a tawm ziehun meihal biehna zosie a vun a hawh sieng zo sih vua, tuaci’n siempu dangte a kisiensuo masang sung teng, nasep a kizaw masangin a sanggamte uh Levi-te in amate hu uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile amau le amau a kisiensuona vuah siempute sangin Levi-te a lungsim uh dihzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Meihal biehna tampite banah thunuom biehna thaute, le meihal biehnate adingin dawn thei biehnate a om hi. Tua bangin Topa’ biehinn sungah nasepna ki-omsahkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mite adinga Pasien in a bawlpieh thute ziehin Hezekiah le mi zosie a kipah uhi; azieh pen tua thu thakhata a piengvat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekiah in Israel mi zosie le Judah tungah Jerusalem-a Topa’ biehinn ah Israel Pasien, Topa’ peisan pawi a bawl dinga a pei nadingun amate vaihlah a, Ephraim le Manasseh tungah zong laihlahte giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen kumpipa le a uliente le Jerusalem-a om a kikhawm zosie in a hla nina sungin peisan pawi bawl ding a kikum zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />(Azieh pen siempute mi a kicingza ding kisiensuo zo nai loin Jerusalem ah mite kikhawm nai lo ahi ziehin amate in a hun lienin pawi a bawl thei sih uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua gelna pen kumpipa le a kikhawm zosie adingin man le kilawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n mite pei-in Israel Pasien, Topa adingin peisan pawi a bawl nadingun Beer-sheba panin Dan cieng dong Israel gam buppi ah tangtawhna khat nei dingin a khensat uhi; azieh pen amate in bawl dinga a kigen bangin a bawl lo uh sawtveipi ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa thupiehsa bangin laitaite in kumpipa le a uliente tung pana laihlahte tawh Israel le Judah gam zosie-ah pei kawikawi-in, “Israel mite aw, Assyria kumpite’ khut sung panin a omlai a suohta sun teng kungah ama a kiheikia thei nadingin, Abraham, Isaac, le Israel Pasien, Topa lamah kilekia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na mu uh bangin Topa Pasien tungah a pu le pate uh a citah lona ziehun sietna a tunsah na pu na pate ule na sanggamte uh bang sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu-in na pu na pate bangin ngawngkhau sih unlen, no kung panin a zauhuoi ama’ lungthahna a kiheidawh thei nadingin Topa tungah no le no kipumpieh zaw unlen, kumtawn adinga a siensuosa ama’ mun siengtho-ah pei-in Topa na Pasien uh’ na sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa lamah na kilekia uleh, na sanggamte ule na tate un amate sala a man mite tung panin khuotuona mu-in, tami gamah ang peikia ding uhi. Azieh pen Topa na Pasien ukhu mi khuotuo siempa le mi hepi siempa ahi a, ama kungah na kilekia uleh ama in note a mai ang heisan sih ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n Ephraim le Manasseh gam sung khuopi khat pan khuopi khat, Zebulun cieng dong laitaite a pei uhi; ahi vangin amate in na nuisanin na zapi a, zong na simmawbawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem ah Asher, Manasseh, le Zebulun mi halkhat beh kiniemkhiehin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa’ thupiehna bangin kumpipa le uliente’ sawlna sem dingin Pasien in Judah tungah lungsim kihuolna guon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hla nina sungin tol saw lo anlum pawi bawl dingin Jerusalem ah mi tampi a kikhawm vua, tuaci’n a kikhawm mihon a tam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate nasep a kipan vua, Jerusalem-a maitamte hemdawhin gimnamtui halna maitam zosie zong a ladawh vua, Kidron Lui-ah a paimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hla nina a ni sawm le li ni-in peisan pawi tuuno a go uhi. Siempute le Levi-te a maizum vua, amate kisiensuo-in Topa’ biehinn sungah meihal biehnate a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in Pasien’ mipa Moses thukham tawh kizui-in a panmun ngai teng uh a la uhi; siempute in Levi-te’ khut tung pana a nga uh sisan a the uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen a kisiensuo lo mi tampi a om uhi; tua ahi ziehin Topa tungah amate a siengtho-a a kibawl nadingin, a siengtho lo mi zosie adingin Levi-te in peisan tuuno a gaw ding uh kisam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen Ephraim, Manasseh, Issachar, le Zebulun mihon tampite sung pan mi tampitah a kisiensuo sih vangun a ngaina lopi-in peisan pawi an a ne uhi. Ahi vangin Hezekiah in amate thu a ngetpieh a, “A hoi Topa aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />mun siengtho siensuona ngaina tawh a kituo sih vangin lungsimtahpi tawh a pu a pate uh’ Pasien Topa a sui mite’ mawna ngaidam in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in Hezekiah’ thungetna za-in mite a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerusalem-a om Israel mite in lungdamna lienpi tawh ni sagi sung tol saw lo anlum pawi a bawl uhi; tuale Levi-te le siempute in Topa adingin a ngaih mama tumtheite tawh kopin a ni ni-in Topa a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hezekiah in Topa’ nasepna-ah a siemna uh a lah thei Levi-te zosie tungah hanthotna thu a gen hi. Tuaci’n mite in ni sagi sung pawi an ne-in thunuom biehpiehnate a pie vua, a pu a pate uh’ Pasien, Topa tungah lungdam a ko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin a kikhawm buppi in adang ni sagi sung ma pawi bawlbe dingin a kihotawh uhi; tuaci’n adang ni sagi sung ma lungdam tahin a bawlbe uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a kikhawmte tungah Judah Kumpipa Hezekiah in biehna dingin bawngtang tulkhat le tuu tul sagi a pie hi. Siempute tampitah amau le amau a kisiensuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Judah mi a kikhawm buppi, siempute le Levi-te, le Israel gam pana a pei a kikhawm buppi, Israel gam pana a pei pemtate, le Judah gam sunga a teng pemtate lungdam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jerusalem khuopi sungah Israel kumpi David’ tapa Solomon huna kipanin tam bang om ngai nai lo ahi ziehin Jerusalem-ah lungdamna lienpi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempute le Levi-te dingto-in mite thupha a pie vua, tuale amau’ awging a kiza hi; A thungetna un vantunga a siengtho ama’ tenna a tung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in tam teng zosie a kiman zaw ciengin tua muna a om Israel zosie Judah khuopite-ah kuonin biehna songte satkehin khuom siengthote a phua vua, Judah le Benjamin gam sung zosie, Ephraim le Manasseh sunga om munsangte le maitamte a suhsiet zaw masangsie uh phelkeh gawp uhi. Tua amau’ neisa khuopi cietah Israel mite zosie a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Heziekiah in siempute le Levi-te amau’ nasep ciet tawh kizui-in a khenkhenin se a, meihal biehnate le thunuom biehnate adingin Topa’ giephuol tunkot tenga na a sem ding, lungdam a ko ding le phatna a pie dingin siempute le Levi-te a se hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa in ama’ neisa sung pana a silpiehte pen meihal biehna ding ahi hi: Topa’ thukham laibu sunga a kigiel bangin zing le nitah a meihal biehnate, sabbath nite, hladet nite, le a kise pawite dinga meihal biehnate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siempute le Levi-te in Topa’ thukham sungah a kipumpieh thei nadingun, Jerusalem-a teng mite in amau’ nga dinga a kilawm a tanh uh a pieh nadingun ama in thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua thu a kithezah behin Israel mite in anpalte, lenggazu, sathau, khuoizu, le lo-a pieng zosie tampitah a pie vua, na zosie panin sawm-ah-khat a kicing tahin a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah khuopite sunga teng Israel mite in bawnghonte le tuute panin sawm-ah-khat le Topa a Pasien uh tunga kisiensuosa a sil ki-apte sung panin sawm-ah-khat te zong peipi-in a lom lomin a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hla thumna sungin amate in tua a lomte cien ding a kipan vua, a hla sagina sungin a man uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hezekiah le uliente pei-in tua a lomte a mu ciengun amate in Topa le a mi Israel-te thupha a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hezekiah in tua a lomte’ thu, siempute le Levi-te a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zadok innkuon pana siempupi pa Azariah in ama dawng a, “Amate in Topa’ biehinn sungah a silpiehte uh ang peipi vua kipanin kote in neh ding a kiningcing tahin ka nei vua, khol ding tampitah zong ka nei uhi; azieh pen Topa in a mite thupha ei pie a, tuaci’n tam bangin nehval tampi ka nei uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in Topa’ biehinn sungah vankoina inndante a bawl nadingun Hezekiah in thu a pie hi; tuale amate in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in silpiehte, sawm-ah-khat le a ki-ap nate muonhuoitahin a puoh uhi. Tuate a van ulien pen pa Levi-te Conaniah ahi a, a nina pen a sanggampa Shimei ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpi Hezekiah le Pasien’ biehinn makaipi pa Azariah’ sena tawh Jehiel, Azaziah, Nahath, Asahel, Jerimoth, Jozabad, Eliel, Ismachiah, Mahath, le Benaiah-te pen Conaniah le a sanggampa Shimei a hu makaite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nisuona lam tunkot cing pa, Levi-te Imnah’ tapa Kore pen Pasien tungah nop thu-a a kipie silpiehte a vanpi pa ahi a, ama pen Topa adinga a kikoicing piehkhietnate le siengtho pen biehnate sekhen ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eden, Miniamin, Jeshua, Shemaiah, Amariah, le Shecaniah-te in siempute’ khuopi sungah a vuoi a khang a kibangin a khen khenin, a sanggamte uh tungah satanh hawmpieh dingin muonhuoitahin ama a hu vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />khang ciemtena sungah a min a kikhum kum thum le a tungsie pasalte, nisim kisapna dung zui-in a khen khenin a panmun utawh kituohin Topa’ biehinn sunga a lut mi zosie tanh a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amau’ pupa innkuon zui-in siempute kisim hi; kum sawmni le a tungsie Levi-te a khenkhenin a panmun utawh kituohin kisim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siempute a tasen zosie, a zite, a tapate, le a tanute utawh a mihon bupin kisimtha hi; bangzieh ahei cile amate pen a siengtho-a a kikepna vuah a muonhuoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amau’ khuopite-a’ ahi taang gam lozaute lahah teng Aaron’ suon siempute ading ahile, a kiciemte siempute lah le Levi-te lahah pasal zosie tungah a khuo khuo-ah amau’ nga ding ciet a hawm dingin mite a min tawh kise hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hezekiah in Judah gam buppi-ah tam bangin a bawl hi; ama in Topa a Pasien mai-ah a hoi a man le a muonhuoi-in sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in Topa’ biehinn nasepna zosie le thukham le thupiehnate tawh kizui-in a sepna-ah ama’ Pasien sui-in, a lungsim zosie tawh a sem hi; tuale a maa a vang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam thute le a muonhuoi tam nasepnate a sep zaw ciengin Judah sim dingin Assyria Kumpipa Sennacherib pei-in Judah busimin kula ki-im khuopite langkhatah phuol sat a, ama adingin tuate zaw a sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sennacherib pei-in Jerusalem sim a sawm lam Hezekiah in a thei ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a uliente le a galhangte tawh khuopi pulama luong tuinahte khahtan a sawm uhi; tuale amate in ama a hu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi tampi kikhawmin gam sunga luong tuinahte le lui zosie a khahtan vua, “Bang dingin Assyria kumpite hing pei-in tui tampi mu ding uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na sem dingin lungkip tahin Hezekiah kipan a, a cimsa kulpi kawm zosie cieng pha-in tua tungah tausang daw a, tuami pulamah kul dang khat a cieng hi; ama in David’ khuopi sunga a om Millo kulpi zong detsah a, galhiemte le lumte tampi a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in mipite tunga a uh dingin galkapmangte koi a, khuopi tunkot tuol-awnga ama kungah amate khawmin amate tungah hanthotna thu genin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Thakhauh unlen hang un. Assyria kumpipa le ama tawh a om mihon zosie mai-ah zau sih unlen, zong lungkie sih un; bangzieh ahei cile ama tawh a omte sangin eite tawh a om pa lienzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama tawh tahsa galhiem beh om hi; ahi vangin eite ei panpi-in i galte ei dopi dingin eite tawh Topa i Pasien a om hi,” a ci hi. Judah kumpipa Hezekiah’ genna panin mite a lungmuong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami thu zaw ciengin Lachish ah a galkap zosie tawh Assyria kumpipa Sennacherib a op laitahin, Jerusalem-a Judah kumpipa Hezekiah le Jerualem-a om Judah kumpipa Hezekiah le Jerusalem-a om Judah mite zosie kungah a nasemte sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Assyria kumpipa Sennacherib in tam bangin gen hi: Note in Jerusalem ki-imtawmna na nan nading uh bang pen muong na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hezekiah in note kungah, “Assyria kumpipa’ khut sung panin Topa i Pasien in ei hundam ding hi,” ang ci ciengin gilkiel dangta-a na si nadingun note ang puikhiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam Hezekiah ma in a munsangte le a maitamte ladawhin Judah le Jerusalem kungah, “Maitam khat mai-ah na bie ding vua, tua tungah na biehnate na lui ding uhi,” ci-in thu pie hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima le ka pu ka pate in gamdang mite zosie tunga ka bawlsate uh na thei sih uh amah? Tua gam minamte’ pasien-te in keima’ khut sung panin amau’ gam a hundam zo mawng uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note’ Pasien in keima’ khut sung panin ang hutdam thei nadingin, ka pu ka pate un a na suhmangsa tua minamte’ pasien zosie lah panin koi pen in a mite a hundam zo ngel ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in Hezekiah in tam bang danin kisolsah sih unlen, zong kipuikhielsah sih un. Ama um sih un. Azieh pen keima khut sung pan hile, ka pu ka pate khut sung pan hile a mite a hundam zo minam khatpo ahi sihle kumpi gam khatpo’ pasien koima a om sih hi. Ka khut sung panin na Pasien un bangza-in note hing hundam zo lo zaw kan ding ahei!” ci un,” a cisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama’ nasemte in Topa Pasien le a nasempa Hezekiah langpangin thu tamzaw gen lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in Israel Pasien Topa simmaw zakona le langpanna laihlahte zong giel a, “Adang gam sunga minamte’ pasien-te in ka khut sung panin a mite a hutkhiet zo lo uh ma bangin Hezekiah’ Pasien in zong a mite hunkhie zo tuom lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua khuopi a lah thei nadingun amate zau-in a linglawn thei nadingun kulpi dawna a om Jerusalem mite kungah Judah ham tawh nahpitahin a awng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihingte’ khut tawh kibawl leitung mite’ pasien-te a gen bang lelun Jerusalem Pasien a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hezekiah le Amoz’ tapa Isaiah in tam thu ziehin thu ngenin vantung lamah a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuale Topa in Assyria kumpipa’ giephuolah mi thahat galhangte le uliente zosie a thatgam vantungmi khat a sawl hi. Tuaci’n ama maizum tahin a gam lamah a kilekia hi. A pasien’ inn sungah a lut ciengin, a tapate pawlkhat in namsau tawh ama na satlia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in Assyria kumpipa Sennacherib’ khut le a gal zosie’ khut sung panin Hezekiah le Jerusalem-a tengte a hundam hi; ama in mun cinteng panin amate tawlngahna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khum hun zaw langsie minam zosie’ muna-ah ama a kitawisang thei nadingin mi tampite in Jerusalem-a Topa kungah letsongte a tawi vua, Judah kumpipa Hezekiah kungah zong van manphate a tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Hezekiah a cina-in si dihtah hi. Ama in Topa kungah thu ngen a, ama in a ngetna dawngin ama tungah lim khat a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama a lungsim a kilietsah ziehin a tunga kibawl phattuomna tawh kituohin Hezekiah in a thuhkia nuom sih hi. Tua ahi ziehin ama le Judah gam le Jerusalem tungah lungthahna a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hezekiah in ama’ lungsim kilietsahna ziehin ama le Jerusalem-a tengte a kiniemkhieh vua, tuaci’n Hezekiah’ hun sungin amate tungah Topa’ lungthahna tung lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hezekiah in minthanna le neisa tampi tah nei hi; tuale ama in ama dingin ngun, kham, suong manphate, gimnamtuite, lumte, le van manpha namkim koi nadingin goukholna innte a bawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />an, lenggazu, le sathau koi nadingin vankholna innte, ganhon namkim khum nadingin ganbuhte, le tuubuhte zong a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua bang ma-in ama adingin khuopite bawl a, tuuhonte le gan honte tampitah khol hi; bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in ama neisa tampi a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tami Hezekiah ma-in Gihon tuinah tungnung khahtanin David’ khuopi nitumna lampangah a zawlsuh hi. A nasepna zosie-ah Hezekiah a maa vang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaci’n gam sunga kibawl lim lamdang kan dinga ama kunga kisawl Babylon uliente’ palaite vai-ah, ama’ lungsim sunga om zosie a thei nadingin Pasien in ama thu-in ama a omsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tu-in Hezekiah’ gamtatna a omlaite, le ama nasep hoite, Judah le Israel Kumpite’ Khang Tangthu Laibu sung, le Amoz’ Tapa, Kamsang Isaiah’ Mangmuna sungah kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Hezekiah lumton a, amate in David’ suonte’ han katona munah ama a vui uhi; ama a si lai-in Judah gam le Jerusalem-a teng zosie in zatahna a pie uhi. A tapa Manasseh in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh a maan ding a kipatin kum sawm le ni pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah kum sawmnga le nga sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite’ mai-ah Topa in a nawmang minamte in a zah a kidahhuoi gamtatnate ma bangin, Topa muna-ah ama a siet gamtat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen a pa Hezekiah’ na suhsietsa ahi munsangte lamkia-in, Baal-te adingin maitamte phut a, khuom siengthote bawlin, vantung na zosie bie a, tuate’ na a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in, “Jerusalem-ah ka min om zing ding hi,” a cina Topa’ biehinn sungah ama in maitamte a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Topa’ biehinn tuol nite-ah vantung na zosie adingin maitamte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Hinnom tapa’ kuomah mei tawh a tapa hal a, mailam thugenkholna, khutlametna-te zang a, mi bum theite, dawilawm neite, le bumtawite thu a dong hi. Topa muna-ah ama in sietna tampi bawlin ama a lungthahsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasien in David le a tapa Solomon kungah, “Israel minamte zosie sung panin ka teelsa tam biehinn sung le Jerusalem sungah keima’ min ka koi zing ding hi, a cina mun Pasien’ biehinn sungah ama in a khensa milim koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in amate ka thupieh zosie, thukham zosie, thupiehte, le Moses tungtawna a kipie biehna ngaina kipte limtaha a zui uleh, na pu na pate vua dinga ka sesa gam panin Israel-te’ keng ka khin ngai nawn sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in Israel mite mai-ah Topa in a na suhsietsa minamte sangin sietna a tam bawl zawh nadingun Manasseh in Judah le Jerusalem-a tengte a lelamin a pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Manasseh le ama’ mite kungah thu gen a, ahi vangin amate in a thuse sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate sim dingin Topa in Assyria galkapmangte puoh a, amate in hatkilih tawh Manasseh manin siakhau tawh kanbawmin Babylon ah a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A lungkham laitahin Topa a Pasien’ angvanna a sui a, a pu a pate’ Pasien mai-ah nahpi-in a kiniemkhieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Pasien kungah thum a, tuale ama in ama’ kutna sangin a ngetna za a, Jerusalem ah a kumpi gam a piekia hi. Tua bepin Topa pen Pasien tahtah ahi lam Manasseh in a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin kuom sung, Gihon nitumna lam, Nga Tunkot lutna dong David khuopi adingin ama in kulbang pulam khat a cieng hi; ama in Ophel kimkotah kul sang mama khat cieng to hi. Ama in Judah gam sung kulnei khuopi zosie-ah zong galkapmangte koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in Topa’ biehinn panin gamdang pasien-te le a milim, le Topa’ biehinn muol tung le Jerusalem-a ama’ na lamsa maitam zosie ladawhin khuo pulamah tuate a paaimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in Topa’ maitam zong a ngai bangin koikia a, tua tungah thunuoma biehpiehna le lungdamkona a pie hi; tuale ama in Israel Pasien Topa’ na a sep nadingun Judah thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanle munsangte-ah mite in biehpiehna a pie lai vua, ahi vangin Topa a Pasien uh kung beh ma-a a pieh uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu-in Manasseh’ gamtatna a omlaite, le a Pasien’ tunga a thungetna, le Israel Pasien, Topa’ min tawh ama tunga thu a gen thumute’ thugente, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Tangthu sungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasien in ama’ thungetna, le ama’ thumna a sanna, le ama’ mawna le a muonhuoi lona zosie, le ama a kiniemkhieh masangin munsangte bawlin khuom siengthote a koina munte thu, Thumute ’ Khang Tangthu sungah kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pu a pate tawh Manasseh lumton a, amate in a inn sungah ama a vui uhi. A tapa Amon in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amon a maan ding kipatin kum sawmni le ni pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah kum ni sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pa Manasseh’ gamtatsa bangin Topa muna-ah a siet gamtat hi. Amon in a pa Manasseh’ bawlsa milim zosie tungah biehpiehnate pie-in tuate’ na a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pa Manasseh bangin Topa’ mai-ah ama le ama a kiniemkhieh sih a, tam Amon in khielna tampi a piengsah semsem zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A nasemte in tha dingin ama a sawmdap vua, a inn sungah a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua gam mite in Kumpi Amon a sawmdap mi zosie that leuleu uhi; tuale gam mite in ama’ za a luo dingin a tapa Josiah kumpi-in koi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah maan ding a kipatin kum giet pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah kum sawmthum le khat sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa muna-ah ama a manin gamta hi; ama in a pu David’ gamtat teng zui-in ziet le vei-ah piel lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’ uh a kum gietna, naupangno ahi lai-in ama in a pu David’ Pasien sui ding a kipan hi. Kum sawm le nina kumin ama in Judah le Jerusalem panin munsangte, khuom siengthote, le a kikheng le a kisung milimte suhmang ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in ama muna-ah Baal-te’ maitamte a sawnpua uhi; ama in tuate tunga a om gimnamtui maitamte phelmang a, khuom siengthote, le a kikheng le a kisung milimte satkehin a gawivui hi; ama in tuate tunga kithoi mite’ han tungah a vuite a the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a maitamte uh tunga siempute’ gute zong hal a, Judah le Jerusalem a siensuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Manasseh, Ephraim, le Simeon khuopite sung le Naphtali khuopi cieng dong, le tua teng zosie’ kimvela a siesate dongin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />maitamte satkehin khuom siengthote satguoi a, Israel gam sung zosie-ah gimnamtui maitamte a satcim hi. Tua ciengin Jerusalem ah ama a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama a maan a kum sawm le gietna kumin gam sung teng le biehinn a siensuo zaw ciengin, Topa a Pasien’ biehinn a puopha dingin ama in Azariah’ tapa Shaphan, le khuopi uhpa Maaseiah, le thuciemte pa Joahaz’ tapa Joah a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siempu lien pa Hilkiah kungah amate a pei vua, kotcing Levi-te in Manasseh, Ephraim, Israel a omlai teng, Judah le Benjamin zosie, le Jerusalem-a tengte kung pana a don uh Pasien’ biehinn sunga a kitawi sumte a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in Topa’ biehinn a van nasemte tungah tua sumte a pie uhi. Topa’ biehinn a van nasemte in biehinn puo nading le biehinn a ngai bahsahkia nadingin a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kito suongte lei nading, le kumpite suhsiet inn kisiete kil nading singte le inn lamna a zah ding innkamte lei nadingin khutsiemte le innlamte tungah a sumte a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mite in muonhuoi tahin na a sem uhi. Amate a van dingin Levi-te Merari suonte sung panin Jahath le Obadiah, le Kohath’ suonte sung panin Zechariah le Meshullam-te kikoi hi. Tumgingte tawh lasah siem adang Levi-te in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />vangih puote le nasep namcin a semte zosie a makai uhi; tuale Levi-te pawlkhat pen laigielte, uliente le kotcingte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in Topa’ biehinn sunga a kipuohsa sumte a lah laitahun siempu Hilkiah in Moses tungtawna a kipie Topa’ thukham laibu a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hilkiah in thuvanpi pa Shaphan kungah, “ Topa’ biehinn sungah thukham laibu ka mu hi,” ci hi; tuale Hilkiah in Shaphan kungah tua laibu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Shaphan in kumpipa kungah tua laibu peipi-in ama kungah, “Na nasemte tunga a ki-ap zosie a sep laitah un
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn sunga kimu sum teng a la sieng vua, nasep makaite le nasemte tungah a pie uhi,” ci-in a gen be lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuvanpi pa Shaphan in kumpipa kungah, “Siempu Hilkiah in keima tungah laibu khat ei pie hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin Shaphan in kumpipa mai-ah a gingin tua laibu a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa in thukham kammalte a zah ciengin a puon a ehmal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Hilkiah, Shaphan’ tapa Ahikam, Micah’ tapa Abdon, thuvanpi pa Shaphan, le kumpipa’ nasempa Asaiah thu pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Pei unlen, tua a kimu laibu sunga kammalte tawh kisai-in keima ading le Israel le Judah gama a kinuasie mite adingin Topa thu va dong ta un; azieh pen i pu i pate in tam laibu sunga a kigiel zosie banga sep ding, Topa’ kammal na zui lo uh ahi ziehin eite tunga ang kibuo Topa’ lungthahna lien hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n Hilkiah le kumpipa in a sawl mite, Hasrah, a tapa Tokhath, a tapa Shallum, biehinn puon kempa’ zi kamsangnu Huldah kungah pei-in (tua nu Jerusalem sung Veng Nina munah a teng hi) tua thu tawh kisai ama kungah a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Israel Pasien, Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Ka kunga ang sawlpa kungah gen un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Keima in tam mun le a tunga teng mite tungah Judah kumpipa mai-a a kisim laibu sunga a kigiel samsietna zosie ahi gimnate ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A nasepte utawh ei lungthahsah nadingun, amate in kei ei nuasie-in pasien dangte tungah biehna a pieh ziehun tami munah ka lungthahna kibuo-in a kiphelmit zo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa thu dong dinga ang sawl Judah kumpipa kungah tam bangin na gen ding uhi: Israel Pasien, Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Na zahsa thute tawh kisai-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tam mun le a tunga a teng mite tungah ama langpanna kammalte na zah ciengin na lungsim kisia-in, Pasien mai-ah nangmama kiniemkhieh na hi zieh le ka mai-ah nangma kiniemkhiehin, na puonte ehmalin ka mai-ah kap na hi ziehin, na thugen ka za zo ta hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na pu na pate kungah kang khawm ding a, lungnuomtahin na han-ah ang kikhawm ding hi. Nangma in tam mun le a sunga tengte tunga ka tunsah ding gimna zosie na mit in a mu sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Amate in kumpipa kungah thu a puohkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in thu vaihlahin Judah le Jerusalem upa zosie kikhawmsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn ah kumpipa, Judah mite zosie, Jerusalem-a teng mite zosie, siempute le Levi-te, le mite zosie a lien a neu tawh peito uhi; ama in Topa’ biehinn sunga a kimu thuciemna laibu sunga thu zosie amau’ zahin a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama munah kumpipa dingin tam laibu sunga a kigiel thuciemna thute a sem dingin a lungsim zosie le a hinna zosie tawh, Topa’ nua a zui nading le ama’ thupiehnate, ama’ thukipte, le ama’ thukhamte a zui nadingin Topa mai-ah thuciemna khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Jerusalem le Benjamin sunga a om mi zosie in tua thu a zui dingin a kiciem uhi. Amau’ pu pate’ Pasien ahi Pasien’ thuciemna dung zui-in Jerusalem-a tengte a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Josiah in Israel mite’ neisa gam zosie panin a kidahhuoi zosie ladawhin Israel sunga a om mi zosie in Topa a Pasien uh a biesah hi. Ama’ hin sung tungtawnin a pu le pate uh’ Pasien, Topa a zuina panun amate a kihei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah in Jerusalem ah Topa adingin peisan pawi a bawl hi; amate in a hla masa a ni sawm le lina ni-in peisan pawi tuuno a go uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in siempute amau’ nasepna munah se a, Topa’ biehinn sunga nasepna-ah amate hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Israel zosie thu a hil, Topa tunga a siengtho Levi-te kungah, “Israel kumpipa David’ tapa Solomon in a lam biehinn sungah a siengtho singkuong koi un. Na liengko tung vua na puoh ding uh a kisam nawn sih hi. Tu-in Topa na Pasien ule a mi Israel-te’ na sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na pu na pate uh’ innkuon sungah a khenkhenin na opna uh tawh kizui-in kithawi unlen, lai tawh kigiel Israel kumpi David’ lamlahnate le lai tawh a kigiel a tapa Solomon’ lamlahnate zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na mipi na tanaute uh a pupa innkuon sungah a pawlpawlin a kikhenna tawh kizui-in siengtho munah panmun la unlen, pupa’ innkuon khenkhat cietah Levi-te kihalsah kim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Peisan tuuno go-in noma ma kisiensuo unlen, Moses tunga Topa’ thugen tawh kizui-in a sem dingin na tanaute uh tangin kithawi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Josiah in a om mite zosie adingin peisan pawi biehna-in ganhon panin tuunote le keelnote tul sawmthum, le bawngtang tulthum a pie hi; tam teng pen kumpipa’ neisa pana kipie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama’ uliente in mite tung, siempute tung, le Levi-te tungah kiphaltahin a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levi-te’ a uhpite, Conaniah, le a sanggamte Shemaiah le Nethanel, le Hashabiah, Jeiel le Jozabad-te in peisan pawi biehna-in Levi-te tungah tuuno le keelno tulnga, le bawngtang zanga a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nasep nading a kithawi zaw ciengun, a mun vuah siempute a ding vua, tuale kumpipa’ thupieh tawh kizui-in amau’ khente sungah Levi-te a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in peisan tuuno a go vua, tuale Levi-te in a vun a hawh laitahun siempute in amate tung pana a nga uh sisan a the uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in Moses laibu sunga kigiel bangin, Topa tunga pieh dingin a pawlpawlin a pu pate uh’ innkuon sungah a kikhenna uh tawh kizui-in, amate tungah a hawm thei nadingun tua meihal biehnate a tuomkoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Biehna ngaina kip tawh kizui-in amate in mei-ah peisan tuuno a hang uhi; tuale beelte, taubeelpi-te, le khangbeelte sungah a siengtho biehnate huonin mi zosie tungah tuate mallang tahin a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin amate in amau-a’ mama ding le siempute adingin a bawl uhi. Azieh pen Aaron’ suon siempute in meihal biehnate le a thau teng la-in zan dongin a kitahla uhi; tuaci’n Levi-te in amate ding le Aaron’ suon siempute adingin a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David’ thupieh bangin Asaph’ suonte ahi lasate, Asaph, Heman, le kumpipa’ thumu pa Jeduthun-te a mun vuah a om uhi; amau’ mun cietah tunkot cingte a om vua, a tanau uh Levi-te in amate ading a bawlpieh ziehun amate in amau’ nasepna a nawngkaisah uh kul lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n Kumpi Josiah’ thupieh dung zui-in peisan pawi bawl ding le Topa’ maitam tungah meihal biehnate pieh nadingin Topa’ nasepna ding zosie khum ni-in a kithawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khum muna om Israel mite in khum hunin peisan pawi, le tol saw lo anlum pawi ni sagi sung a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kamsangpa Samuel hun lai-a kipanin Israel sungah tua bang peisan pawi kibawl ngai nai lo hi; Josiah, le siempute le Levi-te, le khumtaha a om Judah le Israel mi zosie, le Jerusalem-a teng mite in a bawl peisan pawi tawh a kibang, Israel kumpite koima in bawl ngai nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Josiah in a uh zaw kum sawm le gietna kumin tam peisan pawi kibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam teng zosiepi nuasang, Josiah in biehinnpi a ngai a bahsah zaw ciengin, Euphrates gun gei Carchemish ah gal sim dingin Egypt kumpi Neco kuonto a, tuale ama do dingin Josiah a kuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin Neco in palai sawl a, “Judah kumpipa aw, kei le nang bang kisai i hei? Tuni-in nang sim dinga ang kuon ka hi sih a, ka galte’ innkuon a sim dinga ang kuon ka hibo hi. Ka kinaw nadingin Pasien in keima thu ei pie zo hi. Ama in nang ang suhsiet lo nadingin keima kunga a om Pasien na langpanna khawl in,” cisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama kung panin Josiah a kilekia nuom sih a, hizongle ama tawh a kido thei nadingin a mel a sel hi. Ama in Neco’ kam sung panin Pasien’ thugente a ngai sih a, Megiddo zanglei-a gal kidona-ah ama na pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thaltawite in Kumpi Josiah a kap uhi; tuale kumpipa in a nasemte kungah, “Nah liem seng ta ka hi ziehin ei puomang dawh ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n leeng tung panin a nasemte in ama ladawhin a leeng nina tungah puo-in Jerusalem a tut uhi. Khum munah ama si a, a pu a pate’ hanah kivui hi. Judah le Jerusalem khuomi zosie in ama a kaa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jeremiah in zong Josiah adingin kaa-teng a lo hi. Tuale numei lasate le pasal lasa zosie in tuni dongin kaa-tengin Josiah’ min a lo uhi. Amate in Israel sungah tam thute ngaina-in a bawl uhi; kaa-la sungah tuate kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu-in Josiah’ gamtatna a omlaite, le Topa’ thukham sunga a kigiel bangin a nasep hoite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />le a gamtatna, a masa le a nukhia-te, Israel le Judah Kumpite’ Tangthu Laibu sungah kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua gam mite in Josiah’ tapa Jehoahaz kicipa Jerusalem ah a pa’ zaluo-in kumpi-in a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jehoahaz a maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni le thum pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah hla thum sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Egypt kumpipa in Jerusalem ah ama zakiesah a, ngun talent zakhat le kham talent khat, tua gam sieh le kaihin kipiesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Egypt kumpipa in Judah le Jerusalem tungah kumpi-in a sanggampa Eliakim koi a, ama’ min pen Jehoiakim-in a kheelpieh hi; ahi vangin Neco in a sanggampa Jehoahaz manin Egypt gamah a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoiakim a maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni le nga pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah kum sawm le khat sung maang hi. Topa a Pasien’ muna-ah ama a sie-in a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama a sim dingin Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar kuonto a, Babylon-a peipi dingin ama siakol bul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar in Topa’ biehinn sunga vanzahte pawlkhat zong Babylon ah puo a, Babylon-a ama kumpi inn sungah tuate koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu-in Jehoiakim’ gamtatna a omlaite, le ama bawl a kidahhuoite, le ama a hoi lona a kimute, Israel le Judah Kumpite’ Tangthu Laibu sungah kigiel hi; tuale a tapa Jehoiakhin in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jehoiachin a maan ding a kipatin kum giet pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah hla thum le ni sawm sung maang hi. Topa muna-ah ama a sie-in gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua kum khuokhal sungin Nebuchadnezzar Kumpipa in mi sawlin, Topa’ biehinn sunga vanzah mantam teng tawh Babylon ah ama vaihlah a, tuale ama’ sanggampa Zedekiah kumpi-in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zedekiah a maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni le khat pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah kum sawm le khat sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa a Pasien’ muna-ah ama siet gamtat hi. Topa’ kammal gensawn ahi kamsang Jeremiah mai-ah ama a kiniemkhieh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasien tawh ama a kiciemsah Nebuchadnezzar zong a ledo hi; ama in a ngawng khauhsahin a lungtang zong khausah a, Israel Pasien Topa lamah a kihei nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siempu makai teng le mipi zosie in zong minamte’ kidahhuoi nate zosie a zui vua, a muonhuoi sih uhi; tuale ama in Jerusalem-a a siensuosa Topa’ biehinn pen amate in a buasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in a mite le a tenna mun tungah lainatna a nei ziehin a pu a pate uh’ Pasien, Topa in amate kungah a kamtaite a sawlkia ngitnget hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hizongle mite tungah Topa’ lungthahna tungin a kidamsah zo lo ding za dongin Pasien’ kamtaite nuisatin, amau’ kammalte a na simmaw vua, amate in kamsangte zong a na zapi den uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate sim dingin Topa in amau’ biehinn munsiengtho sunga namsau tawh a tangvalte a that, le ngahnu tangval, khanghamte le a zawngkhal mite tungah lainatna a nei lo Chaldea-te’ kumpipa a puoh hi; ama in a unpi-in ama’ khut sungah amate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in Pasien’ inn sunga vanzah a gol a neu, Topa’ inn sunga goute le kumpipa le a uliente’ gou zosie a unpi-in Babylon ah a puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in Pasien’ inn a haltum vua, Jerusalem kulpi kawm satkehin, mei tawh kumpipa’ inn zosie a haltum vua, vanzah manpha zosie a susie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in Babylon ah namsau pana a suohta mite salin kai a, Persia kumpi gam a kiphu ni cieng dongin amate, ama le a tapate’ sal a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A sabbath-te adingin tua leitang a kibawl dong cieng, Jeremiah kam tungtawnin Topa’ thugen a tangtun nading ahi hi. Kum sawm sagi a cin nadingin leitang a kinuasie hun sung teng zosie leitang in sabbath a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Persia kumpipa Cyrus’ kum khatna kumin, Jeremiah’ kam pana Topa’ thu a tangtun thei nadingin, Persia kumpipa Cyrus in tangko khat sawl a, lai-a kigiel kumpi thupieh zong ama’ kumpi gam zosie-ah a tangko nadingin Topa in Persia kumpipa Cyrus’ lungsim a thampieh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Persia kumpipa Cyrus in tam bangin a gen hi: Vantung Pasien, Topa in leitung kumpi gam zosie ei pie zo a, Judah gam sunga Jerusalem ah ama ading biehinn khat a lampieh dingin keima ei sawl zo hi. Note lahah ama’ mi a om poma, Topa a Pasien in ompi taheh! Ama kuontosah heh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
</usx>
